elligence artificielle qui génère des fichiers de lancement ROS 2 Python et des configurations de multi-nœuds","de":"ros2-launch-system ist ein KI-Tool, das ROS 2 Python-Startdateien und Multi-Node-Konfigurationen erstellt","pt":"O que é ROS 2 Launch System? É uma ferramenta que gera arquivos de lançamento para o ROS 2.","ru":"Что такое ROS 2 Launch System? Это инструмент, который генерирует файлы запуска для ROS 2.","ar":"ما هو نظام إطلاق ROS 2؟ هو أداة تنتج ملفات إطلاق للROS 2."},"features":{"en":["Generate accurate ROS 2 Python launch files","Support multi-node configurations","Follow official ROS 2 Humble patterns","Used for creating lessons in physical AI textbooks","Used for writing multi-node deployment exercises","Used for generating worked examples"],"zh":["生成准确的 ROS 2 Python 启动文件","支持多节点配置","遵循官方 ROS 2 Humble 模式","用于物理 AI 教科书的课程创建","用于编写多节点部署练习","用于生成工作示例"],"ja":["正確な ROS 2 Python 起動ファイルを生成","マルチノード構成をサポート","公式の ROS 2 Humble パターンに従う","物理 AI 教科書のレッスン作成に使用","マルチノードデプロイの練習を記述するために使用","ワーク例を生成するために使用"],"ko":["정확한 ROS 2 Python 시작 파일 생성","多 노드 구성 지원","공식 ROS 2 Humble 패턴을 따름","물리적 AI 교과서의 수업 생성에 사용","다중 노드 배포 연습을 작성하는 데 사용","작업 예제 생성에 사용"],"es":["Generación de archivos de lanzamiento de ROS 2 Python","Configuración de multi-nodos siguiendo patrones oficiales de ROS 2 Humble","Integración con el libro de texto de Physical AI","Compatibilidad con Chapter 6 y Chapter 7 de Physical AI","Acceso a documentación en vivo"],"fr":["Génération de fichiers de lancement ROS 2 Python","Configuration de multi-nœuds suivant les modèles officiels de ROS 2 Humble","Intégration avec le manuel de Physical AI","Compatibilité avec le Chapitre 6 et le Chapitre 7 de Physical AI","Accès à la documentation en direct"],"de":["Erstellung von ROS 2 Python-Startdateien","Konfiguration von Multi-Node-Konfigurationen nach offiziellen ROS 2 Humble-Mustern","Integration mit dem Physical AI-Lehrbuch","Kompatibilität mit Kapitel 6 und Kapitel 7 von Physical AI","Zugriff auf Live-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Geração de arquivos de lançamento Python precisos para o ROS 2","Compatibilidade com os padrões oficiais do ROS 2 Humble","Suporte à configuração de parâmetros e composição de nós","Integração com o capstone project do Chapter 7","Suporte à criação de lições em Chapter 6"],"ru":["Генерация точных файлов запуска Python для ROS 2","Совместимость с официальными стандартами ROS 2 Humble","Поддержка конфигурации параметров и составления узлов","Интеграция с проектом капSTONE в главе 7","Поддержка создания уроков в главе 6"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات إطلاق Python دقيقة للROS 2","التوافق مع معايير ROS 2 Humble الرسمية","دعم تكوين المعلمات وتركيب العقد","التكامل مع مشروع الحجر الزاوية في الفصل 7","دعم إنشاء الدروس في الفصل 6"]},"keywords":{"en":["ROS 2","Python","launch files","multi-node configurations","physical AI","textbooks","lesson creation","exercises","AI agents"],"zh":["ROS 2","Python","启动文件","多节点配置","物理 AI","教科书","课程创建","练习","AIエージェント"],"ja":["ROS 2","Python","起動ファイル","マルチノード構成","物理 AI","教科書","レッスン作成","練習","AIエージェント"],"ko":["ROS 2","Python","시작 파일","다중 노드 구성","물리적 AI","교과서","수업 생성","연습","AI 에이전트"],"es":["ros2-launch-system","ROS 2 Python","configuración de multi-nodos","patrones de ROS 2 Humble","Physical AI","desarrollo de inteligencia artificial","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","Agentes de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["ros2-launch-system","ROS 2 Python","configuration de multi-nœuds","modèles de ROS 2 Humble","Physical AI","développement d''intelligence artificielle","outils d''intelligence artificielle","Agents d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["ros2-launch-system","ROS 2 Python","Konfiguration von Multi-Node-Konfigurationen","Muster von ROS 2 Humble","Physical AI","Entwicklung von KI","KI-Tools","KI-Agents"],"pt":["ROS 2 Launch System","desenvolvimento de robótica","Python para robótica","ROS 2 Humble","configuração de parâmetros","composição de nós","capstone project","líções de robótica","ferramentas de robótica"],"ru":["ROS 2 Launch System","разработка робототехники","Python для робототехники","ROS 2 Humble","конфигурация параметров","составление узлов","проект капSTONE","уроки робототехники","инструменты робототехники"],"ar":["نظام إطلاق ROS 2","تطوير الروبوتات","Python للروبوتات","ROS 2 Humble","تكوين المعلمات","تركيب العقد","مشروع الحجر الزاوية","دروس الروبوتات","أدوات الروبوتات"]}},"owner":"mjunaidca","repo":"robolearn","repoPath":"mjunaidca/robolearn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.297Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ros2-launch-system","description":"Generate ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node system configurations for educational content. This skill should be used when creating lessons that teach launch file syntax, writing exercises involving multi-node startup, parameter configuration, or generating worked examples for robot system deployment.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# ROS 2 Launch System Skill\n\n**Purpose**: Generate accurate, educational ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node configurations following official ROS 2 Humble patterns for the Physical AI textbook.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating lessons in Chapter 6 (Building Robot Systems)\n- Writing multi-node deployment exercises\n- Generating worked examples for system startup\n- Teaching parameter configuration and node composition\n- Chapter 7 capstone project integration\n\n## Live Documentation Access\n\n**CRITIC","body":"# ROS 2 Launch System Skill\n\n**Purpose**: Generate accurate, educational ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node configurations following official ROS 2 Humble patterns for the Physical AI textbook.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating lessons in Chapter 6 (Building Robot Systems)\n- Writing multi-node deployment exercises\n- Generating worked examples for system startup\n- Teaching parameter configuration and node composition\n- Chapter 7 capstone project integration\n\n## Live Documentation Access\n\n**CRITICAL**: Before generating any code, fetch current ROS 2 documentation using Context7 MCP:\n\n```\nTool: mcp__context7__resolve-library-id\nlibraryName: \"ros2 launch\"\n\nThen:\nTool: mcp__context7__get-library-docs\ncontext7CompatibleLibraryID: [resolved ID]\ntopic: \"launch file python\"\n```\n\nThis ensures launch patterns match current ROS 2 Humble API.\n\n## Launch File Patterns\n\n### Basic Launch File (Canonical)\n\n```python\n# File: launch/robot_system.launch.py\n\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''publisher_node'',\n            name=''sensor_publisher'',\n            output=''screen'',\n        ),\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''subscriber_node'',\n            name=''data_processor'',\n            output=''screen'',\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n### Launch File with Parameters\n\n```python\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''configurable_node'',\n            name=''robot_controller'',\n            output=''screen'',\n            parameters=[{\n                ''robot_name'': ''my_robot'',\n                ''update_rate'': 10.0,\n                ''max_speed'': 1.5,\n                ''enabled_sensors'': [''lidar'', ''camera'', ''imu''],\n            }],\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n### Launch File with Parameter File (YAML)\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom ament_index_python.packages import get_package_share_directory\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    config = os.path.join(\n        get_package_share_directory(''my_robot_pkg''),\n        ''config'',\n        ''robot_params.yaml''\n    )\n\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''robot_node'',\n            name=''robot_controller'',\n            output=''screen'',\n            parameters=[config],\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n### Parameter File (YAML)\n\n```yaml\n# File: config/robot_params.yaml\nrobot_controller:\n  ros__parameters:\n    robot_name: \"physical_ai_bot\"\n    update_rate: 20.0\n    max_linear_speed: 2.0\n    max_angular_speed: 1.57\n    sensors:\n      lidar:\n        enabled: true\n        topic: \"/scan\"\n      camera:\n        enabled: true\n        topic: \"/image_raw\"\n```\n\n### Launch File with Arguments\n\n```python\nfrom launch import LaunchDescription\nfrom launch.actions import DeclareLaunchArgument\nfrom launch.substitutions import LaunchConfiguration\nfrom launch_ros.actions import Node\n\ndef generate_launch_description():\n    # Declare launch arguments\n    robot_name_arg = DeclareLaunchArgument(\n        ''robot_name'',\n        default_value=''default_robot'',\n        description=''Name of the robot''\n    )\n\n    sim_mode_arg = DeclareLaunchArgument(\n        ''sim_mode'',\n        default_value=''true'',\n        description=''Run in simulation mode''\n    )\n\n    return LaunchDescription([\n        robot_name_arg,\n        sim_mode_arg,\n        Node(\n            package=''my_robot_pkg'',\n            executable=''robot_node'',\n            name=''robot_controller'',\n            output=''screen'',\n            parameters=[{\n                ''robot_name'': LaunchConfiguration(''robot_name''),\n                ''simulation'': LaunchConfiguration(''sim_mode''),\n            }],\n        ),\n    ])\n```\n\n## Package Structure for Launch Files\n\n```\nmy_robot_pkg/\n├── my_robot_pkg/\n│   ├── __init__.py\n│   ├── publisher_node.py\n│   └── subscriber_node.py\n├── launch/\n│   ├── robot_system.launch.py\n│   └── debug_system.launch.py\n├── config/\n│   ├── robot_params.yaml\n│   └── debug_params.yaml\n├── package.xml\n├── setup.py\n└── setup.cfg\n```\n\n### setup.py (Essential Parts for Launch)\n\n```python\nfrom setuptools import setup\nimport os\nfrom glob import glob\n\npackage_name = ''my_robot_pkg''\n\nsetup(\n    name=package_name,\n    version=''0.1.0'',\n    packages=[package_name],\n    data_files=[\n        (''share/ament_index/resource_index/packages'',\n            [''resource/'' + package_name]),\n        (''share/'' + package_name, [''package.xml'']),\n        # Include launch files\n        (os.path.join(''share'', package_name, ''launch''),\n            glob(''launch/*.launch.py'')),\n        # Include config files\n        (os.path.join(''share'', package_name, ''config''),\n            glob(''config/*.yaml'')),\n    ],\n    install_requires=[''setuptools''],\n    entry_points={\n        ''console_scripts'': [\n            ''publisher_node = my_robot_pkg.publisher_node:main'',\n            ''subscriber_node = my_robot_pkg.subscriber_node:main'',\n        ],\n    },\n)\n```\n\n## Debugging Multi-Node Systems\n\n### Using ros2doctor\n\n```bash\n# Check system health\nros2 doctor\n\n# Verbose output\nros2 doctor --report\n```\n\n### Using rqt_graph\n\n```bash\n# Visualize node graph\nros2 run rqt_graph rqt_graph\n```\n\n### Logging Levels\n\n```python\n# In node code\nself.get_logger().debug(''Detailed debug info'')\nself.get_logger().info(''Normal operation'')\nself.get_logger().warn(''Warning condition'')\nself.get_logger().error(''Error occurred'')\nself.get_logger().fatal(''Fatal error'')\n```\n\n```bash\n# Set log level at runtime\nros2 run my_pkg my_node --ros-args --log-level debug\n```\n\n## Educational Requirements\n\n### Layer 1 (Manual Foundation)\n- Explain launch file structure and purpose\n- Walk through LaunchDescription components\n- Demonstrate parameter passing patterns\n\n### Layer 2 (AI Collaboration)\n- Generate launch files from system requirements\n- Debug multi-node communication issues with AI\n- Optimize node configuration (Three Roles INVISIBLE)\n\n### Layer 3 (Intelligence Design)\n- System architecture patterns\n- Configuration management strategies\n- Reusable launch file components\n\n### Layer 4 (Spec-Driven)\n- Design system from specification\n- Multi-node integration testing\n- Capstone project orchestration\n\n## Hardware Tier Compatibility\n\nAll launch files MUST work on:\n- **Tier 1**: Cloud ROS 2 (TheConstruct) with turtlesim\n- **Tier 2+**: Local ROS 2 Humble with physical robots\n\nLaunch commands:\n```bash\n# Build and source\ncd ~/ros2_ws\ncolcon build --packages-select my_robot_pkg\nsource install/setup.bash\n\n# Launch\nros2 launch my_robot_pkg robot_system.launch.py\n\n# Launch with arguments\nros2 launch my_robot_pkg robot_system.launch.py robot_name:=my_bot sim_mode:=false\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes to Prevent\n\n1. **Missing data_files in setup.py**: Launch files won''t be installed\n2. **Wrong path in get_package_share_directory**: Package name must match\n3. **Forgetting to rebuild**: Changes require `colcon build`\n4. **Parameter type mismatches**: YAML types must match node expectations\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- **ros2-publisher-subscriber**: Nodes to launch\n- **ros2-service-pattern**: Service nodes in system\n- **ros2-custom-interfaces**: Interface packages as dependencies\n- **lesson-generator**: For full lesson structure\n\n## Authoritative Source\n\nAll patterns verified against:\n- https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Intermediate/Launch/Creating-Launch-Files.html\n- https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-Client-Libraries/Using-Parameters-In-A-Class-Python.html\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:18.625Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Robotics Agents requiring advanced ROS 2 launch file generation and multi-node configuration capabilities","zh":"适用于需要高级 ROS 2 启动文件生成和多节点配置能力的 Robotics Agents","ja":"ROS 2 起動ファイルの高度な生成とマルチノード構成機能を必要とするロボティクス エージェントに適しています","ko":"고급 ROS 2 시작 파일 생성 및 다중 노드 구성 기능을 필요로 하는 로봇 공학 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de robótica que requieren generación avanzada de archivos de lanzamiento de ROS 2 y capacidades de configuración de multi-nodo","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de robotique nécessitant une génération avancée de fichiers de lancement ROS 2 et des capacités de configuration de multi-nœuds","de":"Ideal für Roboteragenten, die eine erweiterte ROS 2-Startdateigenerierung und Multi-Knoten-Konfigurationsfunktionen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de robótica que exigem geração avançada de arquivos de lançamento do ROS 2 e capacidades de configuração de multi-nó","ru":"Идеально подходит для роботов-агентов, требующих продвинутой генерации файлов запуска ROS 2 и возможностей конфигурации нескольких узлов","ar":"مثالي لعميل الروبوت الذي يتطلب توليد متقدم لملفات إطلاق ROS 2 وقدرات تكوين متعدد العقد"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate accurate ROS 2 Python launch files and multi-node configurations following official ROS 2 Humble patterns, leveraging Python and ROS 2 libraries for seamless robot system integration and deployment","zh":"赋予代理生成准确的 ROS 2 Python 启动文件和多节点配置，遵循官方 ROS 2 Humble 模式，利用 Python 和 ROS 2 库实现无缝的机器人系统集成和部署","ja":"エージェントに、公式の ROS 2 Humble パターンに従った正確な ROS 2 Python 起動ファイルとマルチノード構成を生成する能力を与え、Python と ROS 2 ライブラリを利用して無邪気なロボットシステムの統合とデプロイを実現します","ko":"에이전트가 공식 ROS 2 Humble 패턴을 따르는 정확한 ROS 2 Python 시작 파일 및 다중 노드 구성 생성을 가능하게 하며, Python 및 ROS 2 라이브러리를 활용하여 무중단 로봇 시스템 통합 및 배포를 구현합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes generar archivos de lanzamiento de ROS 2 Python precisos y configuraciones de multi-nodo siguiendo los patrones oficiales de ROS 2 Humble, aprovechando Python y bibliotecas de ROS 2 para una integración y implementación de sistemas de robots sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des fichiers de lancement ROS 2 Python précis et des configurations de multi-nœuds suivant les modèles officiels ROS 2 Humble, en exploitant Python et les bibliothèques ROS 2 pour une intégration et un déploiement de systèmes de robots sans problème","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, genaue ROS 2-Python-Startdateien und Multi-Knoten-Konfigurationen zu generieren, die den offiziellen ROS 2-Humble-Mustern folgen, indem Python und ROS 2-Bibliotheken für eine nahtlose Integration und Bereitstellung von Robotersystemen genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerar arquivos de lançamento Python do ROS 2 precisos e configurações de multi-nó seguindo padrões oficiais do ROS 2 Humble, aproveitando bibliotecas Python e ROS 2 para integração e implantação de sistemas de robôs sem problemas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать точные файлы запуска Python ROS 2 и конфигурации нескольких узлов, следуя официальным шаблонам ROS 2 Humble, используя библиотеки Python и ROS 2 для бесшовной интеграции и развертывания систем роботов","ar":"يمنح العملاء khảية توليد ملفات إطلاق دقيقة من Python لROS 2 وتكوين متعدد العقد اتباعًا لنمط ROS 2 Humble الرسمي، واستخدام مكتبات Python وROS 2 من أجل دمج نظام الروبوت وتوزيعه بسلاسة"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating educational ROS 2 launch files for Physical AI textbook lessons","Creating multi-node deployment exercises for robot systems","Configuring parameter settings and node composition for ROS 2 projects"],"zh":["为物理 AI 教科书课程生成教育 ROS 2 启动文件","为机器人系统创建多节点部署练习","配置 ROS 2 项目的参数设置和节点组成"],"ja":["物理 AI 教科書のレッスン用に教育用の ROS 2 起動ファイルを生成する","ロボットシステム用にマルチノード構成の練習を作成する","ROS 2 プロジェクトのパラメータ設定とノード構成を構成する"],"ko":["물리적 AI 교과서 수업용 교육용 ROS 2 시작 파일 생성","로봇 시스템용 다중 노드 구성 연습 생성","ROS 2 프로젝트의 매개 변수 설정 및 노드 구성 구성"],"es":["Generar archivos de lanzamiento de ROS 2 educativos para lecciones de libros de texto de Inteligencia Artificial Física","Crear ejercicios de implementación de multi-nodo para sistemas de robots","Configurar la configuración de parámetros y la composición de nodos para proyectos de ROS 2"],"fr":["Générer des fichiers de lancement ROS 2 éducatifs pour les leçons de manuels scolaires d''Intelligence Artificielle Physique","Créer des exercices de déploiement de multi-nœuds pour le