اتبع دليلنا خطوة بخطوة لتكوين واختبار مهاراتك."},"definition":{"en":"skill-builder is a tool for creating and managing Claude Code skills, following the Agent Skills specification","zh":"Skill Builder 是一个用于创建和管理 Claude Code 技能的工具","ja":"Skill Builder は、Claude Code スキルの作成と管理を行うツールです","ko":"Skill Builder는 Claude Code 스킬을 생성하고 관리하는 툴입니다","es":"El skill-builder es una herramienta para crear habilidades de Claude Code que siguen las mejores prácticas y la especificación de habilidades de Agentes de IA","fr":"Le skill-builder est un outil pour créer des compétences de Claude Code qui suivent les meilleures pratiques et la spécification des compétences des Outils d''IA","de":"Der skill-builder ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von KI-Agents-Fähigkeiten, die den Best Practices und der Spezifikation entsprechen","pt":"O Skill Builder é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento para criar habilidades personalizadas para Ferramentas de IA.","ru":"Skill Builder - это инструмент разработки для создания пользовательских навыков для ИИ Агентов.","ar":"Skill Builder هو أداة تطوير لإنشاء مهارات مخصصة للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"features":{"en":["Creates well-structured Claude Code skills in .claude/skills/ or ~/.claude/skills/ directories","Generates SKILL.md files using a predefined template","Supports addition of supporting files such as scripts, references, and assets","Enables testing of skills by asking Claude to perform matching tasks","Follows the Agent Skills specification for consistency and compatibility"],"zh":["支持项目和个人技能目录","提供 SKILL.md 模板","支持脚本、引用和资产文件","允许测试技能","遵循 Agent Skills 规范","支持快速入门"],"ja":["プロジェクトと個人スキルディレクトリをサポート","SKILL.md テンプレートを提供","スクリプト、参照、資産ファイルをサポート","スキルのテストを許可","Agent Skills の仕様に従う","クイックスタートをサポート"],"ko":["프로젝트와 개인 스킬 디렉토리를 지원","SKILL.md 템플릿을 제공","스크립트, 참조, 자산 파일을 지원","스킬 테스트를 허용","에이전트 스킬 규격을 따름","快速 시작을 지원"],"es":["Creación de habilidades de Claude Code en el proyecto o en la carpeta personal","Generación de archivos SKILL.md con plantilla predefinida","Adición de archivos de soporte como scripts y assets","Pruebas de habilidades mediante solicitudes de tareas a Claude","Seguimiento de las mejores prácticas para habilidades de Agentes de IA","Estructura de habilidades bien organizada"],"fr":["Création de compétences de Claude Code dans le projet ou dans le dossier personnel","Génération de fichiers SKILL.md avec un modèle prédéfini","Ajout de fichiers de support tels que des scripts et des assets","Tests de compétences via des demandes de tâches à Claude","Suivi des meilleures pratiques pour les compétences des Outils d''IA","Structure de compétences bien organisée"],"de":["Erstellung von KI-Agents-Fähigkeiten im Projekt oder im persönlichen Verzeichnis","Generierung von SKILL.md-Dateien mit vordefinierter Vorlage","Hinzufügen von Unterstützungsdateien wie Skripten und Assets","Testen von Fähigkeiten durch Anfragen von Aufgaben an Claude","Einhalten der Best Practices für KI-Agents-Fähigkeiten","Gut strukturierte Fähigkeitsstruktur"],"pt":["Criação de habilidades bem estruturadas","Modelo de habilidade personalizável","Suporte a scripts e referências","Teste de habilidades com tarefas de correspondência","Integração com o CLI do Claude"],"ru":["Создание хорошо структурированных навыков","Пользовательский шаблон навыка","Поддержка скриптов и ссылок","Тестирование навыков с помощью задач соответствия","Интеграция с CLI Claude"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات متقنة","نموذج مهارة مخصص","دعم للبرامج النصية والمراجع","اختبار المهارات باستخدام مهام مطابقة","التكامل مع CLI Claude"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use skill-builder","what is skill-builder","skill-builder alternative","skill-builder vs Claude Code","skill-builder install","skill-builder setup guide","Claude Code skills development","AI agent skills creation","Agent Skills specification"],"zh":["AI工具","Skill Builder","Claude Code","Agent Skills","最佳实践","开发效率","快速入门","SKILL.md","脚本","引用","资产文件"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Skill Builder","Claude Code","Agent Skills","ベストプラクティス","開発効率","クイックスタート","SKILL.md","スクリプト","参照","資産ファイル"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Skill Builder","Claude Code","에이전트 스킬","최고의 실践","개발 효율성","快速 시작","SKILL.md","스크립트","참조","자산 파일"],"es":["skill-builder","Agentes de IA","Herramientas de IA","Desarrollo de habilidades de IA","Mejores prácticas para habilidades de IA","Estructura de habilidades de IA","Creación de habilidades de Claude Code","Pruebas de habilidades de IA"],"fr":["skill-builder","Outils d''IA","Agents d''IA","Développement de compétences d''IA","Meilleures pratiques pour les compétences d''IA","Structure de compétences d''IA","Création de compétences de Claude Code","Tests de compétences d''IA"],"de":["skill-builder","KI-Agents","KI-Tools","Entwicklung von KI-Fähigkeiten","Best Practices für KI-Fähigkeiten","Struktur von KI-Fähigkeiten","Erstellung von KI-Fähigkeiten mit Claude Code","Tests von KI-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Skill Builder","Ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de habilidades","criação de habilidades","modelos de habilidade","testes de habilidades","CLI Claude","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Skill Builder","ИИ Агенты","разработка навыков","создание навыков","шаблоны навыков","тестирование навыков","CLI Claude","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["Skill Builder","الوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير المهارات","إنشاء المهارات","نماذج المهارة","اختبار المهارات","CLI Claude","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"mc-zuri","repo":"mineflayer-bedrock","repoPath":"mc-zuri/mineflayer-bedrock","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.314Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-builder","description":"Create new Claude Code skills with proper SKILL.md format, frontmatter, and best practices. Use when building, scaffolding, or generating a new skill for Claude Code.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Claude Code Skill Builder\n\nCreate well-structured Claude Code skills that follow best practices and the Agent Skills specification.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Choose skill location**: Project (`.claude/skills/`) or Personal (`~/.claude/skills/`)\n2. **Create directory**: `{location}/{skill-name}/`\n3. **Generate SKILL.md** using template below\n4. **Add supporting files** (scripts, references, assets) as needed\n5. **Test the skill** by asking Claude to perform matching tasks\n\n## SKILL.md Template\n\nCre","body":"# Claude Code Skill Builder\n\nCreate well-structured Claude Code skills that follow best practices and the Agent Skills specification.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Choose skill location**: Project (`.claude/skills/`) or Personal (`~/.claude/skills/`)\n2. **Create directory**: `{location}/{skill-name}/`\n3. **Generate SKILL.md** using template below\n4. **Add supporting files** (scripts, references, assets) as needed\n5. **Test the skill** by asking Claude to perform matching tasks\n\n## SKILL.md Template\n\nCreate file at: `{location}/{skill-name}/SKILL.md`\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: your-skill-name\ndescription: Clear description of what this skill does (max 200 chars). Include trigger keywords users would naturally say.\nallowed-tools: Read, Write, Glob, Grep, Bash\nmetadata:\n  author: your-name\n  version: \"1.0\"\n---\n\n# Your Skill Name\n\nBrief overview of the skill''s purpose.\n\n## When to use\n\n- Trigger condition 1\n- Trigger condition 2\n- Trigger condition 3\n\n## When NOT to use\n\n- Exclusion condition 1\n- Exclusion condition 2\n\n## Instructions\n\nStep-by-step guidance for completing the workflow:\n\n1. **First step**: Description\n2. **Second step**: Description\n3. **Third step**: Description\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: [Scenario Name]\n\n**Input**: User says \"...\"\n\n**Output**: Claude does...\n\n## Common mistakes to avoid\n\n- Mistake 1 and how to prevent it\n- Mistake 2 and how to prevent it\n\n## References\n\n| Resource | Location |\n|----------|----------|\n| Documentation | `references/docs.md` |\n| API Reference | `references/api.md` |\n```\n\n## Frontmatter Reference\n\n### Required Fields\n\n| Field | Constraints | Purpose |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `name` | Max 64 chars, lowercase, hyphens only | Unique identifier (must match directory name) |\n| `description` | Max 200 chars, non-empty | **Critical** - Claude uses this to decide when to invoke |\n\n### Optional Fields\n\n| Field | Purpose | Example |\n|-------|---------|---------|\n| `license` | License type | `Apache-2.0`, `MIT` |\n| `allowed-tools` | Pre-approved tools | `Read, Write, Glob, Grep, Bash` |\n| `compatibility` | Environment requirements | `node >= 18, unix` |\n| `metadata` | Custom key-value pairs | `author: name`, `version: \"1.0\"` |\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\nskill-name/\n├── SKILL.md           # Required - Core instructions (<500 lines)\n├── scripts/           # Optional - Executable code (Python/Bash)\n│   └── helper.py\n├── references/        # Optional - Documentation loaded into context\n│   ├── api.md\n│   └── schema.md\n└── assets/            # Optional - Templates, config files\n    └── template.json\n```\n\n### File Purposes\n\n| Folder | Purpose | Loading |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `SKILL.md` | Core instructions | Always (when skill activates) |\n| `scripts/` | Repeatable automation | Executed on demand |\n| `references/` | Extended documentation | Read into context on demand |\n| `assets/` | Templates and resources | Used for output generation |\n\n## Writing Effective Descriptions\n\nThe description is **critical** - it determines whether Claude activates your skill.\n\n### Good Description Pattern\n\n```\n[What it does] + [When to use it with trigger keywords]\n```\n\n### Examples\n\n**Good:**\n```yaml\ndescription: Extract text and tables from PDF files, fill forms, merge documents. Use when working with PDFs, forms, or document extraction.\n```\n\n**Good:**\n```yaml\ndescription: Generate TypeScript API clients from OpenAPI specs. Use when creating SDK, API wrapper, or client code from swagger/openapi files.\n```\n\n**Bad:**\n```yaml\ndescription: Helps with PDFs.\n```\n\n**Bad:**\n```yaml\ndescription: A utility for API work.\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Keep SKILL.md Concise\n\n- Target under 500 lines (~5,000 tokens)\n- Move detailed documentation to `references/`\n- Use tables and bullet points over prose\n\n### Define Clear Boundaries\n\nAlways include both:\n- **When to use**: Positive triggers\n- **When NOT to use**: Negative boundaries to prevent over-activation\n\n### Use Relative Paths\n\nReference files using paths relative to skill root:\n- `scripts/extract.py`\n- `references/api-docs.md`\n- `assets/template.html`\n\n### Security\n\n- Never hardcode secrets, API keys, or passwords\n- Audit scripts from untrusted sources\n- Use environment variables for sensitive config\n\n## Skill vs MCP Server\n\n| Feature | Skills | MCP Servers |\n|---------|--------|-------------|\n| Purpose | **How** to do something | **Access** to something |\n| Contains | Instructions, templates | Tools, resources |\n| Loading | On-demand (progressive) | Upfront |\n| Best for | Workflows, standards | Data access, APIs |\n\nA skill can orchestrate multiple MCP servers. Use skills for workflow logic and MCP for connectivity.\n\n## Testing Checklist\n\n1. [ ] Directory name matches `name` in frontmatter\n2. [ ] Description includes trigger keywords\n3. [ ] SKILL.md under 500 lines\n4. [ ] All file references use relative paths\n5. [ ] When/When NOT sections are clear\n6. [ ] Examples demonstrate expected behavior\n7. [ ] Restart Claude Code to load new skill\n8. [ ] Test with natural language matching description\n\n## Example: Complete Skill\n\n### code-review Skill\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: code-review\ndescription: Review code for bugs, security issues, and best practices. Use when reviewing PRs, checking code quality, or auditing implementations.\nallowed-tools: Read, Glob, Grep\nmetadata:\n  author: team\n  version: \"1.0\"\n---\n\n# Code Review\n\nSystematic code review following team standards.\n\n## When to use\n\n- Reviewing pull requests\n- Checking code before commit\n- Auditing security-sensitive code\n- Evaluating code quality\n\n## When NOT to use\n\n- Simple typo fixes (just fix them)\n- Understanding code (use exploration instead)\n- Writing new code (use appropriate coding skill)\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n### Security\n- [ ] No hardcoded secrets\n- [ ] Input validation present\n- [ ] SQL injection prevention\n- [ ] XSS prevention\n\n### Code Quality\n- [ ] Functions under 50 lines\n- [ ] Clear naming conventions\n- [ ] Error handling present\n- [ ] No dead code\n\n### Testing\n- [ ] Unit tests for new functions\n- [ ] Edge cases covered\n- [ ] Integration tests if needed\n\n## Output Format\n\nProvide findings as:\n\n| Severity | File:Line | Issue | Suggestion |\n|----------|-----------|-------|------------|\n| High | src/auth.ts:42 | Hardcoded API key | Use env variable |\n| Medium | src/user.ts:15 | Missing null check | Add optional chaining |\n```\n\n## Documentation Links\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| Skills Overview | https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills |\n| Creating Skills | https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12512198 |\n| Agent Skills Spec | https://github.com/anthropics/skills/blob/main/agent_skills_spec.md |\n| Template Skill | https://github.com/anthropics/skills/tree/main/template-skill |\n| Best Practices | https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/agents-and-tools/agent-skills |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Workflow Skill\n\nFor multi-step processes:\n```markdown\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Gather**: Collect required information\n2. **Validate**: Check prerequisites\n3. **Execute**: Perform main action\n4. **Verify**: Confirm success\n```\n\n### Template Skill\n\nFor generating files:\n```markdown\n## Template Usage\n\n1. Copy template from `assets/template.ext`\n2. Replace placeholders: `{{name}}`, `{{date}}`\n3. Save to destination\n```\n\n### Integration Skill\n\nFor connecting services:\n```markdown\n## Integration Steps\n\n1. Check MCP server is connected\n2. Authenticate if needed\n3. Call required endpoints\n4. Transform response\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:43.692Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agent Developers needing streamlined skill creation for Claude Code with best practices and Agent Skills specification adherence.","zh":"适合需要为 Claude Code 流线化技能创建并遵循最佳实践和 Agent Skills 规范的 AI Agent 开发人员。","ja":"Claude Code のスキル作成をストリームライン化し、ベストプラクティスと Agent Skills の仕様に従う必要がある AI エージェント開発者に最適です。","ko":"Claude Code 에 대한 스킬 생성을 스트림라인화하고 최선의 thực践과 에이전트 스킬 사양을遵守해야하는 AI 에이전트 개발자에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de Agentes de IA que necesitan una creación de habilidades simplificada para Claude Code con las mejores prácticas y adherencia a la especificación de Habilidades de Agente.","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs d''agents IA ayant besoin d''une création de compétences simplifiée pour Claude Code avec les meilleures pratiques et la conformité à la spécification des compétences d''agent.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Agent-Entwickler, die eine vereinfachte Fähigkeitserstellung für Claude Code mit Best Practices und Einhaltung der Agentenfähigkeitenspezifikation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de Agentes de IA que necessitam de criação de habilidades simplificada para Claude Code com as melhores práticas e aderência à especificação de Habilidades de Agente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разработчиков агентов ИИ, которым необходима упрощенная создание навыков для Claude Code с соблюдением лучших практик и спецификации навыков агента.","ar":"مثالي لمطوري وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مهارات مبسطة ل Claude Code مع أفضل الممارسات والامتثال لمواصفات مهارات الوكيل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers developers to create well-structured Claude Code skills with adherence to best practices and the Agent Skills specification, streamlining AI agent development through SKILL.md templates and organized directory structures, utilizing file formats like SKILL.md and location specifications such as .claude/skills/ or ~/.claude/skills/","zh":"赋予开发人员创建结构良好的 Claude Code 技能的能力，遵循最佳实践和 Agent Skills 规范，通过 SKILL.md 模板和组织好的目录结构，利用文件格式如 SKILL.md 和位置规范如 .claude/skills/ 或 ~/.claude/skills/，从而简化 AI 에이전트的开发。","ja":"開発者がベストプラクティスと Agent Skills の仕様に従って、構造化された Claude Code のスキルを作成できるようにします。SKILL.md テンプレートと整理されたディレクトリ構造を使用して、ファイル形式として SKILL.md や .claude/skills/ または ~/.claude/skills/ などの位置指定を利用し、AI エージェントの開発を効率化します。","ko":"개발자가 최선의 实践과 에이전트 스킬 사양을遵守하여 구조화된 Claude Code 스킬을 생성할 수 있도록 해줍니다. SKILL.md 템플릿과 조직화된 디렉토리 구조를 사용하여 파일 형식으로 SKILL.md 또는 .claude/skills/ 또는 ~/.claude/skills/ 등의 위치 사양을 활용하여 AI 에이전트 개발을 간소화합니다.","es":"Permite a los desarrolladores crear habilidades de Claude Code bien estructuradas con adherencia a las mejores prácticas y la especificación de Habilidades de Agente, simplificando el desarrollo de agentes de IA a través de plantillas SKILL.md y estructuras de directorios organizadas, utilizando formatos de archivo como SKILL.md y especificaciones de ubicación como .claude/skills/ o ~/.claude/skills/","fr":"Permet aux développeurs de créer des compétences de Claude Code bien structurées avec une conformité aux meilleures pratiques et à la spécification des compétences d''agent, simplifiant le développement d''agents IA via des modèles SKILL.md et des structures de répertoires organisées, en utilisant des formats de fichiers tels que SKILL.md et des spécifications d''emplacement telles que .claude/skills/ ou ~/.claude/skills/","de":"Ermöglicht es Entwicklern, gut strukturierte Claude Code-Fähigkeiten mit Einhaltung der Best Practices und der Agentenfähigkeitenspezifikation zu erstellen, indem sie die Entwicklung von AI-Agents durch SKILL.md-Vorlagen und organisierte Verzeichnisstrukturen vereinfachen, wobei Dateiformate wie SKILL.md und Spezifikationen wie .claude/skills/ oder ~/.claude/skills/ verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os desenvolvedores a criar habilidades de Claude Code bem estruturadas com aderência às melhores práticas e à especificação de Habilidades de Agente, simplificando o desenvolvimento de agentes de IA por meio de modelos de SKILL.md e estruturas de diretório organizadas, utilizando formatos de arquivo como SKILL.md e especificações de localização, como .claude/skills/ ou ~/.claude/skills/","ru":"Наделяет разработчиков возможностью создавать хорошо структурированные навыки Claude Code с соблюдением лучших практик и спецификации навыков агента, упрощая разработку агентов ИИ посредством шаблонов SKILL.md и организованных структур каталогов, используя форматы файлов, такие как SKILL.md, и спецификации местоположения, такие как .claude/skills/ или ~/.claude/skills/","ar":"يمنح المطورين khảية إنشاء مهارات Claude Code منظمة جيدًا مع اتباع أفضل الممارسات ومواصفات مهارات الوكيل، وبذلك يُبسّط تطوير وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي من خلال نماذج SKILL.md وهياكل دلاليّة منظمة، مع استخدام تنسيقات الملفات مثل SKILL.md ومواصفات المواقع مثل .claude/skills/ أو ~/.claude/skills/"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating well-structured Claude Code skills","Streamlining AI agent development with best practices","Organizing skills into project or personal directories"],"zh":["创建结构良好的 Claude Code 技能","通过最佳实践简化 AI 에이전트开发","将技能组织到项目或个人目录中"],"ja":["構造化された Claude Code のスキルを作成する","ベストプラクティスを使用して AI エージェントの開発を効率化する","スキルをプロジェクトまたは個人のディレクトリに整理する"],"ko":["구조화된 Claude Code 스킬을 생성한다","최선의 实践을 사용하여 AI 에이전트 개발을 간소화한다","스킬을 프로젝트 또는 개인 디렉토리에 조직화한다"],"es":["Creación de habilidades de Claude Code bien estructuradas","Simplificación del desarrollo de agentes de IA con las mejores prácticas","Organización de habilidades en directorios de proyecto o personales"],"fr":["Création de compétences de Claude Code bien structurées","Simplification du développement d''agents IA avec les meilleures pratiques","Organisation des compétences dans des répertoires de projet ou personnels"],"de":["Erstellung gut strukturierter Claude Code-Fähigkeiten","Vereinfachung der Entwicklung von AI-Agents mit Best Practices","Organisation von Fähigkeiten in Projekt- oder persönlichen Verzeichnissen"],"pt":["Criando habilidades de Claude Code bem estruturadas","Simplificando o desenvolvimento de agentes de IA com as melhores práticas","Organizando habilidades em diretórios de projeto ou pessoais"],"ru":["Создание хорошо структурированных навыков Claude Code","Упрощение разработки агентов ИИ с соблюдением лучших практик","Организация навыков в проектных или личных каталогах"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات Claude Code منظمة جيدًا","تيسير تطوير وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي مع اتباع أفضل الممارسات","تنظيم المهارات في دلاليات المشروع أو الشخصية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Claude Code and Agent Skills specification","Limited to creating skills for Claude Code agents"],"zh":["需要理解 Claude Code 和 Agent Skills 规范","仅限为 Claude Code 에이전트创建技能"],"ja":["Claude Code と Agent Skills の仕様を理解する必要がある","Claude Code エージェント用のスキルを作成することのみに限定される"],"ko":["Claude Code 와 에이전트 스킬 사양을 이해해야한다","Claude Code 에이전트를 위한 스킬 생성에만限定된다"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de Claude Code y la especificación de Habilidades de Agente","Limitado a la creación de habilidades para agentes de Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de Claude Code et de la spécification des compétences d''agent","Limité à la création de compétences pour les agents de Claude Code"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis von Claude Code und der Agentenfähigkeitenspezifikation","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Fähigkeiten für Claude Code-Agents"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do Claude Code e da especificação de Habilidades de Agente","Limitado à criação de habilidades para agentes de Claude Code"],"ru":["Требует понимания Claude Code и спецификации навыков агента","Ограничен созданием навыков только для агентов Claude Code"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم Claude Code ومواصفات مهارات الوكيل","محدود بإنشاء مهارات لوكيل Claude Code فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"746a9e95e82207c57fd0c384f7d64c339398c5561cb15c4884f0e21d6ccc8ae5","qualityScore":65}');
