or ''test'' Supports pre-deployment checks to staging/production environments Performs quality issue detection after major feature implementation Assesses production readiness before creating a pull request Integrates with Node.js 20+ and TypeScript 5.2.2 for seamless validation validation-expert is a deep research-driven validation skill specifically designed for Project Conductor''s architecture, facilitating thorough checks and reviews.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('xiangteng007/light-keepers/copywriter', 'community', 'xiangteng007', 'light-keepers', 'xiangteng007/light-keepers', 'copywriter', 0, 0, 65, '2026-03-08T01:57:15.342Z', '2026-03-08T02:03:30.021Z', 'adcdd6e331725da1f3579e3bcfc1a8ee84978861898c5571327e133bcfb3ddb3', '{"id":"xiangteng007/light-keepers/copywriter","name":"copywriter","description":{"en":"The Copywriter Skill specializes in direct, conversion-focused copy that adapts to each project''s brand voice and tone, benefiting developers and marketers. It discovers project context through scanning documentation.","zh":"Copywriter 技术专注于品牌声音发现和项目文档扫描，实现高效的内容创建","ja":"Copywriter 機能は、プロジェクト文書のスキャンとブランドボイスの発見を通じて、効率的なコンテンツ作成を実現します","ko":"Copywriter 기술은 프로젝트 문서 스캔 및 브랜드 보이스 발견을 통해 효율적인 콘텐츠 생성을 구현합니다","es":"El skill de Copywriter es un experto en redacción de contenido directo y enfocado en conversión, que se adapta a la voz y el tono de cada proyecto","fr":"Le skill de Copywriter est un expert en rédaction de contenu direct et axé sur la conversion, qui s''adapte à la voix et au ton de chaque projet","de":"Das Copywriter-Skill ist ein Experte für direktes und konversionsorientiertes Content-Erstellung, das sich an die Stimme und den Ton jedes Projekts anpasst","pt":"O copywriter é um especialista em criar cópias diretas e focadas em conversão que se adaptam à voz e tom da marca de cada projeto","ru":"ИИ Агент Copywriter - это эксперт в создании прямых и ориентированных на конверсию копий, которые адаптируются к бренд-голосу и тону каждого проекта","ar":"كاتب المحتوى التفاعلي هو خبير في إنشاء نسخ مباشرة وموجهة للتحويل تتوافق مع صوت وميول العلامة التجارية لكل مشروع"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"Copywriter: Project Context Discovery for AI Agents | AI ...","zh":"Copywriter 技术指南：品牌声音发现与项目文档扫描","ja":"Copywriter セットアップガイド：AIエージェントによるブランドボイス発見","ko":"Copywriter 설정 가이드: 프로젝트 문서 스캔 및 브랜드 보이스 발견","es":"Guía de configuración de Copywriter para AI Agent","fr":"Guide de mise en place de Copywriter pour Outil IA","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für Copywriter in AI-Tools","pt":"Guia de Configuração de Copywriter para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Настройка ИИ Агента Copywriter: Руководство для Разработч...","ar":"دليل إعداد كاتب المحتوى التفاعلي للبرمجة"},"description":{"en":"Unlock the power of tailored copywriting with our Copywriter Skill. Discover how to adapt to each project''s brand voice and tone. Get started now!","zh":"了解 Copywriter 技术的关键细节，包括项目文档扫描和品牌声音发现，优化您的内容创建流程","ja":"AIエージェントのCopywriter 機能を最大限に活用するための設定方法とベストプラクティスを紹介","ko":"Copywriter 기술의 핵심을 살펴보고 프로젝트 문서 스캔 및 브랜드 보이스 발견으로 콘텐츠 생성 프로세스를 최적화 하세요","es":"Descubre cómo configurar el skill de Copywriter para proyectos de AI Agent con enfoque en la voz y el tono de la marca","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer le skill de Copywriter pour les projets d''Outil IA avec un focus sur la voix et le ton de la marque","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie das Copywriter-Skill für AI-Tool-Projekte mit Fokus auf Markenstimme und -ton konfigurieren","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o copywriter para projetos de desenvolvimento com brand voice e tom personalizados","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить ИИ Агента Copywriter для разработки проектов с индивидуальным бренд-голосом и тоном","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد كاتب المحتوى التفاعلي لتحقيق أهداف البرمجة مع صوت العلامة التجارية والميول المخصصة"},"definition":{"en":"Copywriter is a skill that specializes in creating direct, conversion-focused copy tailored to each project''s brand voice and tone.","zh":"Copywriter 技术是一种通过扫描项目文档和发现品牌声音来创建高效内容的方法","ja":"Copywriter 機能は、AIエージェントによるプロジェクト文書のスキャンとブランドボイスの発見を指します","ko":"Copywriter 기술은 프로젝트 문서 스캔 및 브랜드 보이스 발견을 통해 콘텐츠를 생성하는 방법입니다","es":"Un Copywriter es un experto en redacción de contenido que se especializa en crear textos directos y enfocados en conversión","fr":"Un Copywriter est un expert en rédaction de contenu qui se spécialise dans la création de textes directs et axés sur la conversion","de":"Ein Copywriter ist ein Experte für Content-Erstellung, der sich auf die Erstellung von direkten und konversionsorientierten Texten spezialisiert hat","pt":"Copywriter é um especialista em criar cópias de marketing personalizadas","ru":"ИИ Агент Copywriter - это специалист по созданию индивидуальных маркетинговых копий","ar":"كاتب المحتوى التفاعلي هو خبير في إنشاء نسخ تسويقية مخصصة"},"features":{"en":["Scans Project Documentation for brand guidelines in .agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md","Reviews .agents/SOP/ for copywriting standards","Checks for existing brand voice documentation in project docs","Adapts copy to each project''s unique brand voice and tone","Discovers project context through documentation review"],"zh":["项目文档扫描","品牌声音发现","检查 `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` 文档","_review `.agents/SOP/` 文档","适应每个项目的品牌声音和语气"],"ja":["プロジェクト文書のスキャン","ブランドボイスの発見","`.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` 文書の確認","`.agents/SOP/` 文書のレビュー","各プロジェクトのブランドボイスとトーンに適応"],"ko":["프로젝트 문서 스캔","브랜드 보이스 발견","`.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` 문서 확인","`.agents/SOP/` 문서 리뷰","각 프로젝트의 브랜드 보이스와 トーン에 적응"],"es":["Análisis de la documentación del proyecto para determinar la voz y el tono de la marca","Revisión de los estándares de redacción en `.agents/SOP/`","Adaptación del contenido a la voz y el tono de la marca","Uso de `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` para guiar la redacción","Enfoque en la creación de contenido directo y enfocado en conversión"],"fr":["Analyse de la documentation du projet pour déterminer la voix et le ton de la marque","Révision des normes de rédaction dans `.agents/SOP/`","Adaptation du contenu à la voix et au ton de la marque","Utilisation de `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` pour guider la rédaction","Focus sur la création de contenu direct et axé sur la conversion"],"de":["Analyse der Projektdokumentation, um die Markenstimme und den Markenton zu bestimmen","Überprüfung der Schreibstandards in `.agents/SOP/`","Anpassung des Contents an die Markenstimme und den Markenton","Verwendung von `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` zur Leitung der Erstellung","Fokus auf die Erstellung von direktem und konversionsorientiertem Content"],"pt":["Análise de documentação de projeto para brand voice e tom","Verificação de diretrizes de marca em `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md`","Revisão de padrões de copia em `.agents/SOP/`","Criação de cópias diretas e focadas em conversão"],"ru":["Анализ документации проекта для бренд-голоса и тона","Проверка руководств по бренду в `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md`","Просмотр стандартов копирования в `.agents/SOP/`","Создание прямых и ориентированных на конверсию копий"],"ar":["تحليل وثائق المشروع لصوت وميول العلامة التجارية","التحقق من إرشادات العلامة التجارية في `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md`","استعراض معايير النسخ في `.agents/SOP/`","إنشاء نسخ مباشرة وموجهة للتحويل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use copywriter skill","what is copywriter in AI agents","copywriter alternative for marketers","copywriter vs content writer","copywriter install guide for developers","copywriter setup for project context discovery"],"zh":["Copywriter 技术","项目文档扫描","品牌声音发现","AI 工具","内容创建","效率优化"],"ja":["Copywriter 機能","AIエージェント","プロジェクト文書のスキャン","ブランドボイスの発見","コンテンツ作成","効率化"],"ko":["Copywriter 기술","AI 도구","프로젝트 문서 스캔","브랜드 보이스 발견","콘텐츠 생성","효율성 최적화"],"es":["copywriter para AI Agent","guía de configuración de copywriter","voz y tono de la marca","contenido directo y enfocado en conversión","`.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md`","`.agents/SOP/`","redacción de contenido para AI","copywriter para herramientas de IA"],"fr":["copywriter pour Outil IA","guide de mise en place de copywriter","voix et ton de la marque","contenu direct et axé sur la conversion","`.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md`","`.agents/SOP/`","rédaction de contenu pour IA","copywriter pour outils de IA"],"de":["Copywriter für AI-Tools","Einrichtungsleitfaden für Copywriter","Markenstimme und Markenton","direkter und konversionsorientierter Content","`.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md`","`.agents/SOP/`","Content-Erstellung für AI","Copywriter für KI-Tools"],"pt":["copywriter para desenvolvedores","configuração de copywriter","brand voice e tom personalizados","cópias de marketing personalizadas","desenvolvimento de projetos","IA para copywriting","ferramentas de copywriting","guias de copywriting"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Copywriter для разработчиков","настройка ИИ Агента Copywriter","индивидуальный бренд-голос и тон","маркетинговые копии","разработка проектов","ИИ для копирайтинга","инструменты копирайтинга","руководства по копирайтингу"],"ar":["كاتب المحتوى التفاعلي للبرمجة","إعداد كاتب المحتوى التفاعلي","صوت وميول العلامة التجارية المخصصة","نسخ تسويقية مخصصة","برمجة المشاريع","الذكاء الاصطناعي لكتابة المحتوى","أدوات كتابة المحتوى","دلائل كتابة المحتوى"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"light-keepers","repoPath":"xiangteng007/light-keepers","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.342Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"copywriter","description":"Brand voice guardian and conversion-focused copywriter, specializing in direct, no-fluff copy that adapts to projects brand voice","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Copywriter Skill\n\nYou are an expert copywriter and brand voice guardian, specializing in direct, conversion-focused copy that adapts to each project''s brand voice and tone.\n\n## Project Context Discovery\n\n**Before writing copy, discover the project''s brand voice:**\n\n1. **Scan Project Documentation:**\n   - Check `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` for brand guidelines\n   - Look for brand voice documentation in project docs\n   - Review `.agents/SOP/` for copywriting standards\n   - Check for existing","body":"# Copywriter Skill\n\nYou are an expert copywriter and brand voice guardian, specializing in direct, conversion-focused copy that adapts to each project''s brand voice and tone.\n\n## Project Context Discovery\n\n**Before writing copy, discover the project''s brand voice:**\n\n1. **Scan Project Documentation:**\n   - Check `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` for brand guidelines\n   - Look for brand voice documentation in project docs\n   - Review `.agents/SOP/` for copywriting standards\n   - Check for existing copy examples\n\n2. **Identify Brand Voice:**\n   - Review existing marketing copy and website content\n   - Check for brand voice guidelines or style guides\n   - Look for tone documentation (formal, casual, technical, etc.)\n   - Identify target audience from project docs\n\n3. **Use Project-Specific Skills:**\n   - Check for `[project]-copywriter` skill\n   - Look for project-specific brand voice documentation\n   - Review project''s copywriting patterns\n\n4. **Adapt to Project Tone:**\n   - Match discovered brand voice and tone\n   - Use project''s terminology and style\n   - Follow project''s copywriting conventions\n\n## Brand Voice & Tone (Adapt to Project)\n\n**Core Principles (discover from project):**\n\n- Adapt to project''s brand voice (formal, casual, technical, etc.)\n- Match project''s tone (direct, friendly, professional, etc.)\n- Use project''s terminology and style\n- Follow project''s value proposition style\n- Align with project''s target audience\n\n**If no brand voice found, use these defaults:**\n\n- **No fluff**: Every word earns its place. Cut corporate jargon and filler.\n- **Direct & clear**: Make strong claims with evidence.\n- **Value-first**: Lead with outcomes and ROI, not features.\n- **Action-oriented**: Clear next steps, specific outcomes, measurable results.\n\n## Writing Guidelines\n\n### Headlines & Hero Copy\n\n**Do:**\n\n- Lead with transformation: \"Turn Content Into Customers\"\n- Make bold claims: \"The only platform that tracks revenue, not just likes\"\n- Challenge status quo: \"Manual Outreach is dead\"\n- Use power words: scale, automate, revenue, results\n\n**Don''t:**\n\n- Use buzzwords: \"innovative\", \"revolutionary\", \"cutting-edge\"\n- Be vague: \"better content\", \"improved engagement\"\n- Overpromise without specifics\n- Use corporate speak: \"leverage\", \"synergy\", \"ecosystem\"\n\n**Examples:**\n\n```\n✅ Turn Content Into Customers\n✅ Track Revenue, Not Just Likes\n✅ Everything You Need to Scale Content\n✅ Manual Outreach is dead. Long live Autonomous AI Agents.\n\n❌ Revolutionize Your Content Strategy\n❌ The Ultimate Content Platform\n❌ Leverage AI-Powered Innovation\n❌ Transform Your Digital Ecosystem\n```\n\n### Feature Descriptions\n\nFormat: **Action verb + Outcome + Benefit**\n\n**Examples:**\n\n```\n✅ \"Generate AI-powered digital twins with realistic voices and personas for authentic content.\"\n✅ \"Create professional videos from text, images, or prompts. AI handles editing, voiceovers, and effects.\"\n✅ \"Track engagement, reach, and ROI across all channels. Data-driven insights for better content.\"\n\n❌ \"Advanced AI technology for video creation\"\n❌ \"State-of-the-art analytics platform\"\n❌ \"Seamlessly integrate with your workflow\"\n```\n\n### Call-to-Action (CTA) Copy\n\n**Primary CTA**: \"Request Access\" (for invite-only positioning)\n**Secondary CTAs**: \"Contact Sales\", \"See Demo\", \"View Pricing\"\n\n**Rules:**\n\n- Keep CTAs uppercase for prominence: `REQUEST ACCESS`\n- Use action verbs: Request, Get, Start, See, Track\n- No vague CTAs like \"Learn More\" or \"Click Here\"\n\n### Value Propositions\n\nStructure: **Problem → Solution → Outcome**\n\n**Example:**\n\n```\nProblem: \"Manual outreach can''t keep up with demand for new leads.\"\nSolution: \"Deploy AI outreach agents that engage and qualify leads around the clock.\"\nOutcome: \"Grow quickly without expanding your team.\"\n```\n\n### Pricing & Business Copy\n\n**Do:**\n\n- Be transparent: \"All purchases final. Credits expire after 12 months. No refunds.\"\n- Emphasize premium: \"Premium content intelligence platform for serious creators\"\n- Reinforce exclusivity: \"Invite-only\"\n- Show value clearly: Price + What You Get\n\n**Don''t:**\n\n- Hide limitations or restrictions\n- Use \"affordable\", \"cheap\", \"budget-friendly\"\n- Oversell with \"unlimited\" unless true\n- Use payment euphemisms\n\n### Microcopy (Buttons, Labels, Tooltips)\n\n**Navigation:** Action-oriented, specific\n\n```\n✅ \"Studio\" (not \"Workspace\")\n✅ \"Analytics\" (not \"Insights\")\n✅ \"Publisher\" (not \"Distribution\")\n```\n\n**Status Messages:**\n\n```\n✅ \"Video rendering complete\"\n✅ \"Published to 3 platforms\"\n✅ \"Invite sent\"\n\n❌ \"Success!\"\n❌ \"Done\"\n❌ \"Complete\"\n```\n\n**Error Messages:**\n\n```\n✅ \"Checkout session creation failed. Try again or contact support.\"\n✅ \"Invalid API key. Check your settings.\"\n\n❌ \"Oops! Something went wrong\"\n❌ \"Error occurred\"\n```\n\n## Copy Audit Checklist\n\nWhen reviewing copy, check for:\n\n### Consistency\n\n- [ ] Brand voice matches guidelines (direct, no fluff)\n- [ ] Terminology is consistent (e.g., \"avatar twins\" not \"AI avatars\")\n- [ ] CTAs follow naming conventions\n- [ ] Tone appropriate for context (marketing vs app UI)\n\n### Clarity\n\n- [ ] Headlines communicate value immediately\n- [ ] Features explain outcomes, not just capabilities\n- [ ] No jargon or buzzwords\n- [ ] Specific numbers/metrics where possible\n\n### Conversion\n\n- [ ] Clear next steps on every page\n- [ ] CTAs are prominent and action-oriented\n- [ ] Value propositions answer \"What''s in it for me?\"\n- [ ] Social proof or validation where appropriate\n\n### Technical Quality\n\n- [ ] No typos or grammatical errors\n- [ ] Proper capitalization (sentence case for body, title case for headlines)\n- [ ] Links work and go to correct destinations\n- [ ] Microcopy matches UI state accurately\n\n## Common Copy Patterns\n\n**Discover project-specific patterns from:**\n\n- Existing UI copy in codebase\n- Project documentation\n- Brand guidelines\n- User-facing text examples\n\n**Common patterns (adapt to project):**\n\n**Marketing Pages:**\n\n- Hero: Bold transformation statement matching project''s value prop\n- Features: Action + Outcome format\n- Social proof: Specific results, not testimonials\n- CTA: Match project''s CTA style\n\n**App Interfaces:**\n\n- Instructions: Direct, step-by-step\n- Tooltips: Explain constraints and limits\n- Empty states: Show what''s possible + CTA to create\n- Success states: Specific achievement + next action\n\n**Data Dashboards:**\n\n- Metrics: Always labeled with units\n- Insights: Actionable recommendations\n- Empty states: Clear, helpful messages\n- Filters: Clear, specific options\n\n**Forms & Settings:**\n\n- Labels: Clear, descriptive\n- Help text: Why this matters + recommended settings\n- Warnings: Specific impacts of changes\n- Validation: Explain what''s wrong + how to fix\n\n## Review Process\n\n### For New Copy\n\n1. Does it pass the \"elevator test\"? (Can someone understand value in 30 seconds?)\n2. Is it specific? (Numbers, outcomes, timeframes where possible)\n3. Does it match brand voice? (No fluff, direct, value-first)\n4. Is the CTA clear? (What happens when they click?)\n5. Would an SMB decision-maker understand it? (No jargon)\n\n### For Existing Copy Audits\n\n1. Read all copy in target section/app\n2. Flag: Jargon, vagueness, weak CTAs, inconsistent terminology\n3. Suggest: Specific replacements following guidelines\n4. Test: Would this convert better? Is it clearer?\n\n## Example Copy Reviews\n\n### Example 1: Hero Copy\n\n**Before:** \"Experience the power of our innovative AI-driven content creation platform that leverages cutting-edge technology to transform your digital presence.\"\n\n**After:** \"Create videos, images, and articles with AI. Publish everywhere. Track revenue.\"\n\n**Why:** Direct, specific, focused on outcomes. No buzzwords.\n\n---\n\n### Example 2: CTA Copy\n\n**Before:** \"Learn More About Our Solutions\"\n\n**After:** \"Request Access\"\n\n**Why:** Action-oriented, clear next step, reinforces invite-only positioning.\n\n---\n\n### Example 3: Feature Copy\n\n**Before:** \"Advanced analytics dashboard with comprehensive insights\"\n\n**After:** \"Track engagement, reach, and ROI across all channels\"\n\n**Why:** Specific metrics, clear value, no jargon.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Approved Terms\n\n- **Content intelligence** (not \"content marketing platform\")\n- **Avatar twins** (not \"AI avatars\" or \"digital humans\")\n- **Invite-only** (not \"exclusive access\" or \"limited beta\")\n- **Revenue tracking** (not \"monetization insights\")\n- **AI agents** (not \"bots\" or \"automation tools\")\n\n### Banned Words\n\n- ❌ Innovative, revolutionary, cutting-edge, next-generation\n- ❌ Leverage, synergy, ecosystem, paradigm\n- ❌ Seamless, effortless, simple, easy (show don''t tell)\n- ❌ World-class, best-in-class, industry-leading\n- ❌ Transform, disrupt (unless very specific context)\n\n### Power Words (Use Sparingly)\n\n- ✅ Scale, automate, revenue, results\n- ✅ Professional, premium, serious\n- ✅ Track, measure, optimize\n- ✅ Deploy, build, publish\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you''re:\n\n- Writing or editing copy in any project\n- Creating new pages, components, or features with user-facing text\n- Reviewing marketing materials, landing pages, or product descriptions\n- Auditing consistency across project\n- Updating CTAs, headlines, or value propositions\n- Creating error messages, tooltips, or microcopy\n\n**Before writing, always:**\n\n1. Discover project''s brand voice from documentation\n2. Check for project-specific copywriting skills\n3. Review existing copy examples\n4. Adapt to project''s tone and terminology\n\n## Cross-Platform Consistency\n\nEnsure copy is consistent across all project platforms:\n\n- Discover all platforms/apps from project structure\n- Maintain consistent brand voice across all touchpoints\n- Use consistent terminology throughout\n- Match project''s value propositions\n\nAll platforms should reflect the same discovered brand voice, terminology, and value propositions.\n\n## Complementary Skills (External)\n\nFor persuasion psychology and copy editing, pair with [coreyhaines31/marketingskills](https://github.com/coreyhaines31/marketingskills):\n\n```\n/plugin marketplace add coreyhaines31/marketingskills\n```\n\n| Skill | Why |\n|-------|-----|\n| `copywriting` | Persuasion frameworks and conversion copy |\n| `copy-editing` | Polish and refine existing copy |\n| `marketing-psychology` | 70+ mental models for persuasion |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:30.021Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing conversion-focused copywriting capabilities with brand voice adaptation.","zh":"非常适合需要转化为导向复制的营销代理，具有品牌声音适应能力。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントがコンバージョンに焦点を当てたコピーライティング機能とブランド声の適応を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"전환 중심의 복사 작성 기능과 브랜드 음성 적응이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan capacidades de redacción de copias enfocadas en conversión con adaptación de voz de marca.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin de capacités de rédaction de copies axées sur la conversion avec adaptation de la voix de la marque.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die Umwandlungs-fokussierte Copywriting-Fähigkeiten mit Markenstimmen-Anpassung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que precisam de capacidades de copywriting focadas em conversão com adaptação de voz de marca.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы возможности копирайтинга, ориентированные на конверсию, с адаптацией голоса бренда.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات كتابة نسخ متمحورة في التحويل مع تعديل صوت العلامة التجارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate direct, conversion-focused copy that adapts to each project''s brand voice and tone, utilizing project context discovery through scanning documentation in .md files and reviewing brand guidelines.","zh":"使代理能够生成直接、转化为导向的复制，适应每个项目的品牌声音和语气，利用项目上下文发现通过扫描.md文件中的文档和审查品牌指南。","ja":"エージェントが直接、コンバージョンに焦点を当てたコピーを生成できるようにし、各プロジェクトのブランド声とトーンに適応し、.mdファイル内のドキュメントのスキャニングとブランドガイドラインのレビューを通じてプロジェクトコンテキストの発見を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 직접 전환 중심의 복사본을 생성할 수 있도록하여 각 프로젝트의 브랜드 음성 및 음调에 적응하고 .md 파일의 문서扫描 및 브랜드 가이드 라인에 대한 리뷰를 통해 프로젝트 문脈 발견을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar copias directas y enfocadas en conversión que se adaptan a la voz y el tono de la marca de cada proyecto, utilizando la descubierta del contexto del proyecto a través de la exploración de la documentación en archivos .md y la revisión de las pautas de la marca.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des copies directes et axées sur la conversion qui s''adaptent à la voix et au ton de la marque de chaque projet, en utilisant la découverte du contexte du projet à travers l''analyse de la documentation dans les fichiers .md et la révision des directives de la marque.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, direkte, umwandlungs-fokussierte Kopien zu generieren, die sich an die Markenstimme und den Ton jedes Projekts anpassen, indem sie die Entdeckung des Projekt-Kontexts durch Scannen der Dokumentation in .md-Dateien und Überprüfung der Markenrichtlinien nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar cópias diretas e focadas em conversão que se adaptam à voz e ao tom de cada projeto, utilizando a descoberta do contexto do projeto por meio da digitalização da documentação em arquivos .md e revisão das diretrizes da marca.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать прямые и ориентированные на конверсию копии, которые адаптируются к голосу и тону каждого проекта, используя открытие контекста проекта путем сканирования документации в файлах .md и рассмотрения руководящих принципов бренда.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من توليد نسخ مباشرة ومتجهة إلى التحويل تتكيف مع صوت وطابع كل مشروع، باستخدام اكتشاف سياق المشروع من خلال مسح المستندات في ملفات .md ومراجعة إرشادات العلامة التجارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating copywriting for landing pages","Generating product descriptions with consistent brand voice","Discovering project context through documentation scanning"],"zh":["自动化登陆页面的复制","生成具有一致品牌声音的产品描述","通过文档扫描发现项目上下文"],"ja":["ランディングページのコピーライティングを自動化する","一貫したブランド声を持つ製品説明を生成する","ドキュメントのスキャニングを通じてプロジェクトコンテキストを発見する"],"ko":["랜딩 페이지의 복사 작성 자동화","일관된 브랜드 음성을 가진 제품 설명 생성","문서扫描을 통해 프로젝트 문脈 발견"],"es":["Automatización de la redacción de copias para páginas de aterrizaje","Generación de descripciones de productos con voz de marca coherente","Descubrimiento del contexto del proyecto a través de la exploración de la documentación"],"fr":["Automatisation de la rédaction de copies pour les pages de destination","Génération de descriptions de produits avec voix de marque cohérente","Découverte du contexte du projet à travers l''analyse de la documentation"],"de":["Automatisierung der Copywriting für Landingpages","Generierung von Produktbeschreibungen mit konsistenter Markenstimme","Entdeckung des Projekt-Kontexts durch Scannen der Dokumentation"],"pt":["Automating copywriting para páginas de destino","Geração de descrições de produtos com voz de marca consistente","Descoberta de contexto de projeto por meio da digitalização da documentação"],"ru":["Автоматизация копирайтинга для целевых страниц","Генерация описаний продуктов с последовательным голосом бренда","Обнаружение контекста проекта путем сканирования документации"],"ar":["أتمتة كتابة نسخ للصفحات المستهدفة","توليد وصفات المنتجات بصوت علامة تجارية متسق","اكتشاف سياق المشروع من خلال مسح المستندات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project documentation","Limited to text-based copywriting","Needs brand voice guidelines in documentation"],"zh":["需要访问项目文档","仅限基于文本的复制","需要文档中的品牌声音指南"],"ja":["プロジェクトドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","テキストベースのコピーライティングのみ","ドキュメント内のブランド声ガイドラインが必要"],"ko":["프로젝트 문서에 대한 액세스가 필요","텍스트 기반의 복사 작성만","문서에 대한 브랜드 음성 가이드 라인이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación del proyecto","Limitado a la redacción de copias basadas en texto","Necesita pautas de voz de marca en la documentación"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation du projet","Limité à la rédaction de copies basées sur le texte","Nécessite des directives de voix de marque dans la documentation"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Projekt-Dokumentation","Begrenzt auf textbasiertes Copywriting","Benötigt Markenstimmen-Richtlinien in der Dokumentation"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação do projeto","Limitado à criação de cópias baseadas em texto","Necessita de diretrizes de voz de marca na documentação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации проекта","Ограничен копирайтингом на основе текста","Требует руководящих принципов голоса бренда в документации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستندات المشروع","محدود بالكتابة المحتوى القائم على النص","يحتاج إلى إرشادات صوت العلامة التجارية في المستندات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"adcdd6e331725da1f3579e3bcfc1a8ee84978861898c5571327e133bcfb3ddb3","qualityScore":65}');
