"reskill-usage es una herramienta de gestión de habilidades para agentes de inteligencia artificial","fr":"reskill-usage est un outil de gestion de compétences pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle","de":"reskill-usage ist ein Tool für die Verwaltung von Fähigkeiten für künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten","pt":"O que é reskill-usage? Um gerenciador de pacotes para habilidades de agentes de IA baseado em Git","ru":"Что такое reskill-usage? Менеджер пакетов для навыков ИИ Агентов на основе Git","ar":"ما هو reskill-usage؟ مدير حزم لمهارات أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي قائم على Git"},"features":{"en":["Declarative configuration via skills.json and skills.lock files","Flexible versioning for precise skill management","Multi-agent support for streamlined skill installation","CLI usage via npm install -g reskill or npx reskill@latest","Support for Node.js versions >= 18.0.0"],"zh":["Git 基础的包管理","声明式配置（skills.json + skills.lock）","灵活的版本管理","多个 AI 工具包的支持","Node.js >= 18.0.0 的支持"],"ja":["Git ベースのパッケージマネージャー","宣言型の構成（skills.json + skills.lock）","柔軟なバージョン管理","複数の AI エージェントスキルのサポート","Node.js >= 18.0.0 のサポート"],"ko":["Git 기반의 패키지 관리자","선언적 구성（skills.json + skills.lock）","유연한 버전 관리","複数의 AI 에이전트 技能 지원","Node.js >= 18.0.0 지원"],"es":["Configuración declarativa con skills.json y skills.lock","Soporte para múltiples agentes","Gestión de versiones flexible","Integración con Node.js y npm","Uso de CLI con npm install -g reskill","Soporte para instalación y administración de habilidades"],"fr":["Configuration déclarative avec skills.json et skills.lock","Support pour les agents multiples","Gestion de versions flexible","Intégration avec Node.js et npm","Utilisation de CLI avec npm install -g reskill","Support pour l''installation et l''administration de compétences"],"de":["Deklarative Konfiguration mit skills.json und skills.lock","Unterstützung für mehrere Agenten","Flexible Versionsverwaltung","Integration mit Node.js und npm","Verwendung von CLI mit npm install -g reskill","Unterstützung für die Installation und Verwaltung von Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Configuração declarativa com skills.json e skills.lock","Versão flexível para gerenciar habilidades de agentes de IA","Suporte a multi-agentes para instalar e compartilhar habilidades","Uso da CLI com npm install -g reskill","Compatibilidade com Node.js >= 18.0.0"],"ru":["Декларативная конфигурация с помощью skills.json и skills.lock","Гибкая версия для управления навыками ИИ Агентов","Поддержка.multi-агентов для установки и обмена навыками","Использование CLI с npm install -g reskill","Совместимость с Node.js >= 18.0.0"],"ar":["تكوين إعلاني مع skills.json و skills.lock","نسخة مرنة لإدارة مهارات أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم متعدد الوكلاء لتثبيت ومشاركة المهارات","استخدام CLI مع npm install -g reskill","التوافق مع Node.js >= 18.0.0"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use reskill-usage","reskill-usage setup guide","reskill-usage alternative","reskill-usage vs npm","reskill-usage install","what is reskill-usage","reskill-usage for AI agents","reskill-usage package manager","reskill-usage skills management"],"zh":["reskill-usage","AI 工具包管理","Git 基础包管理","声明式配置","灵活的版本管理","Node.js","AI 工具包安装","AI 工具包管理器"],"ja":["reskill-usage","AIエージェントスキル管理","Git ベースのパッケージマネージャー","宣言型の構成","柔軟なバージョン管理","Node.js","AIエージェントスキルインストール","AIエージェントスキルマネージャー"],"ko":["reskill-usage","AI 에이전트 技能 관리","Git 기반 패키지 관리자","선언적 구성","유연한 버전 관리","Node.js","AI 에이전트 技能 설치","AI 에이전트 技能 관리자"],"es":["agentes de inteligencia artificial","reskill-usage","gestión de habilidades","Node.js","npm","CLI","configuración declarativa","soporte para múltiples agentes","versiones flexibles"],"fr":["agents d''intelligence artificielle","reskill-usage","gestion de compétences","Node.js","npm","CLI","configuration déclarative","support pour les agents multiples","versions flexibles"],"de":["künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten","reskill-usage","Verwaltung von Fähigkeiten","Node.js","npm","CLI","deklarative Konfiguration","Unterstützung für mehrere Agenten","flexible Versionsverwaltung"],"pt":["reskill-usage","gerenciador de pacotes para IA","habilidades de agentes de IA","npm para IA","configuração declarativa","versão flexível","desenvolvimento de IA"],"ru":["reskill-usage","менеджер пакетов для ИИ","навыки ИИ Агентов","npm для ИИ","декларативная конфигурация","гибкая версия","разработка ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["reskill-usage","مدير حزم لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مهارات أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","npm لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكوين إعلاني","نسخة مرنة","تنمية أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"kanyun-inc","repo":"reskill","repoPath":"kanyun-inc/reskill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reskill-usage","description":"Teaches AI agents how to use reskill — a Git-based package manager for AI agent skills. Covers CLI commands, install formats, configuration, publishing, and common workflows.","version":"0.1.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"<!-- source: README.md -->\n<!-- synced: 2026-02-12 -->\n\n# reskill Usage Guide\n\nreskill is a Git-based package manager for AI agent skills. It provides declarative configuration (`skills.json` + `skills.lock`), flexible versioning, and multi-agent support for installing, managing, and sharing skills across projects and teams.\n\n**Requirements:** Node.js >= 18.0.0\n\n**CLI usage:** If `reskill` is installed globally, use it directly. Otherwise use `npx reskill@latest`:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g reskill","body":"<!-- source: README.md -->\n<!-- synced: 2026-02-12 -->\n\n# reskill Usage Guide\n\nreskill is a Git-based package manager for AI agent skills. It provides declarative configuration (`skills.json` + `skills.lock`), flexible versioning, and multi-agent support for installing, managing, and sharing skills across projects and teams.\n\n**Requirements:** Node.js >= 18.0.0\n\n**CLI usage:** If `reskill` is installed globally, use it directly. Otherwise use `npx reskill@latest`:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g reskill        # Global install\nnpx reskill@latest <command>  # Or use npx directly (no install needed)\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n\n- Wants to install, update, or manage AI agent skills\n- Mentions `skills.json`, `skills.lock`, or reskill-related concepts\n- Wants to publish a skill to a registry\n- Asks about supported install formats (GitHub, GitLab, HTTP, OSS, registry, etc.)\n- Encounters reskill-related errors or needs troubleshooting\n- Wants to set up a project for skill management\n- Asks about multi-agent skill installation (Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, etc.)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Initialize a new project\nnpx reskill@latest init\n\n# Install a skill\nnpx reskill@latest install github:anthropics/skills/skills/frontend-design@latest\n\n# List installed skills\nnpx reskill@latest list\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n| Command               | Alias                | Description                               |\n| --------------------- | -------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `init`                | -                    | Initialize `skills.json`                  |\n| `find <query>`        | -                    | Search for skills in the registry         |\n| `install [skills...]` | `i`                  | Install one or more skills                |\n| `list`                | `ls`                 | List installed skills                     |\n| `info <skill>`        | -                    | Show skill details                        |\n| `update [skill]`      | `up`                 | Update skills                             |\n| `outdated`            | -                    | Check for outdated skills                 |\n| `uninstall <skill>`   | `un`, `rm`, `remove` | Remove a skill                            |\n| `publish [path]`      | `pub`                | Publish a skill to the registry ¹         |\n| `login`               | -                    | Authenticate with the registry ¹          |\n| `logout`              | -                    | Remove stored authentication ¹            |\n| `whoami`              | -                    | Display current logged in user ¹          |\n| `doctor`              | -                    | Diagnose environment and check for issues |\n| `completion install`  | -                    | Install shell tab completion              |\n\n> ¹ Registry commands (`publish`, `login`, `logout`, `whoami`) require a private registry deployment. Not available for public use yet.\n\nRun `reskill <command> --help` for complete options and detailed usage.\n\n### Common Options\n\n| Option                    | Commands                             | Description                                                   |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--no-save`               | `install`                            | Install without saving to `skills.json` (for personal skills) |\n| `-g, --global`            | `install`, `uninstall`, `list`       | Install/manage skills globally (user directory)               |\n| `-a, --agent <agents...>` | `install`                            | Specify target agents (e.g., `cursor`, `claude-code`)         |\n| `--mode <mode>`           | `install`                            | Installation mode: `symlink` (default) or `copy`              |\n| `--all`                   | `install`                            | Install to all agents                                         |\n| `-y, --yes`               | `install`, `uninstall`, `publish`    | Skip confirmation prompts                                     |\n| `-f, --force`             | `install`                            | Force reinstall even if already installed                     |\n| `-s, --skill <names...>`  | `install`                            | Select specific skill(s) by name from a multi-skill repo      |\n| `--list`                  | `install`                            | List available skills in the repository without installing    |\n| `-r, --registry <url>`    | `install`, `publish`                 | Registry URL override for registry-based installs             |\n| `-t, --token <token>`     | `install`                            | Auth token for registry API requests (for CI/CD)              |\n| `-j, --json`              | `list`, `info`, `outdated`, `doctor` | Output as JSON                                                |\n\n## Source Formats\n\nreskill supports installing skills from multiple sources:\n\n```bash\n# GitHub shorthand\nnpx reskill@latest install github:user/skill@v1.0.0\n\n# GitLab shorthand\nnpx reskill@latest install gitlab:group/skill@latest\n\n# Full Git URL (HTTPS)\nnpx reskill@latest install https://github.com/user/skill.git\n\n# Full Git URL (SSH)\nnpx reskill@latest install git@github.com:user/skill.git\n\n# GitHub/GitLab web URL (with branch and subpath)\nnpx reskill@latest install https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-skills/tree/main/skills/web-design-guidelines\n\n# Custom registry (self-hosted GitLab, etc.)\nnpx reskill@latest install gitlab.company.com:team/skill@v1.0.0\n\n# HTTP/OSS archives\nnpx reskill@latest install https://example.com/skills/my-skill-v1.0.0.tar.gz\nnpx reskill@latest install oss://bucket/path/skill.tar.gz\nnpx reskill@latest install s3://bucket/path/skill.zip\n\n# Registry-based (requires registry deployment)\nnpx reskill@latest install @scope/skill-name@1.0.0\nnpx reskill@latest install skill-name\n\n# Install multiple skills at once\nnpx reskill@latest install github:user/skill1 github:user/skill2@v1.0.0\n```\n\n### Monorepo Support\n\nFor repositories containing multiple skills, specify the path to the skill directory:\n\n```bash\n# Shorthand format with subpath\nnpx reskill@latest install github:org/monorepo/skills/planning@v1.0.0\nnpx reskill@latest install gitlab:company/skills/frontend/components@latest\n\n# URL format with subpath\nnpx reskill@latest install https://github.com/org/monorepo.git/skills/planning@v1.0.0\nnpx reskill@latest install git@gitlab.company.com:team/skills.git/backend/apis@v2.0.0\n\n# GitHub web URL automatically extracts subpath\nnpx reskill@latest install https://github.com/org/monorepo/tree/main/skills/planning\n```\n\n**Requirements**: The specified directory must contain a valid `SKILL.md` file following the [Agent Skills Specification](https://agentskills.io).\n\n### HTTP/OSS URL Support\n\nSkills can be installed directly from HTTP/HTTPS URLs pointing to archive files:\n\n| Format       | Example                                                    | Description              |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| HTTPS URL    | `https://example.com/skill.tar.gz`                         | Direct download URL      |\n| Aliyun OSS   | `https://bucket.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/skill.tar.gz` | Aliyun OSS URL           |\n| AWS S3       | `https://bucket.s3.amazonaws.com/skill.tar.gz`             | AWS S3 URL               |\n| OSS Protocol | `oss://bucket/path/skill.tar.gz`                           | Shorthand for Aliyun OSS |\n| S3 Protocol  | `s3://bucket/path/skill.tar.gz`                            | Shorthand for AWS S3     |\n\n**Supported archive formats:** `.tar.gz`, `.tgz`, `.zip`, `.tar`\n\n### Version Formats\n\n| Format | Example           | Description                        |\n| ------ | ----------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| Exact  | `@v1.0.0`         | Lock to specific tag               |\n| Latest | `@latest`         | Get the latest tag                 |\n| Range  | `@^2.0.0`         | Semver compatible (>=2.0.0 <3.0.0) |\n| Branch | `@branch:develop` | Specific branch                    |\n| Commit | `@commit:abc1234` | Specific commit hash               |\n| (none) | -                 | Default branch (main)              |\n\n## Configuration\n\n### skills.json\n\nThe project configuration file, created by `reskill init`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"skills\": {\n    \"planning\": \"github:user/planning-skill@v1.0.0\",\n    \"internal-tool\": \"internal:team/tool@latest\"\n  },\n  \"registries\": {\n    \"internal\": \"https://gitlab.company.com\"\n  },\n  \"defaults\": {\n    \"installDir\": \".skills\",\n    \"targetAgents\": [\"cursor\", \"claude-code\"],\n    \"installMode\": \"symlink\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n- `skills` — Installed skill references (name → source ref)\n- `registries` — Custom Git registry aliases\n- `defaults.installDir` — Where skills are stored (default: `.skills`)\n- `defaults.targetAgents` — Default agents to install to\n- `defaults.installMode` — `symlink` (default, recommended) or `copy`\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n| Variable            | Description                                     | Default                        |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `RESKILL_CACHE_DIR` | Global cache directory                          | `~/.reskill-cache`             |\n| `RESKILL_TOKEN`     | Auth token (takes precedence over ~/.reskillrc) | -                              |\n| `RESKILL_REGISTRY`  | Default registry URL                            | `https://registry.reskill.dev` |\n| `DEBUG`             | Enable debug logging                            | -                              |\n| `NO_COLOR`          | Disable colored output                          | -                              |\n\n## Multi-Agent Support\n\nSkills are installed to `.skills/` by default and can be integrated with any agent:\n\n| Agent          | Path                                  |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| Cursor         | `.cursor/rules/` or `.cursor/skills/` |\n| Claude Code    | `.claude/skills/`                     |\n| Codex          | `.codex/skills/`                      |\n| Windsurf       | `.windsurf/skills/`                   |\n| GitHub Copilot | `.github/skills/`                     |\n| OpenCode       | `.opencode/skills/`                   |\n\nUse `--agent` to target specific agents, or `--all` to install to all detected agents:\n\n```bash\n# Install to specific agents\nreskill install github:user/skill -a cursor claude-code\n\n# Install to all detected agents\nreskill install github:user/skill --all\n```\n\n## Publishing\n\n> **Note:** Publishing requires a private registry deployment.\n\n### Authentication\n\n```bash\n# Login with a token (obtain from the registry web UI)\nreskill login --registry <url> --token <token>\n\n# Check current login status\nreskill whoami\n\n# Logout\nreskill logout\n```\n\nTokens are stored in `~/.reskillrc`. You can also use the `RESKILL_TOKEN` environment variable (takes precedence, useful for CI/CD).\n\nRegistry URL resolution priority:\n1. `--registry` CLI option\n2. `RESKILL_REGISTRY` environment variable\n3. `defaults.publishRegistry` in `skills.json`\n\n### Publishing a Skill\n\n```bash\n# Validate without publishing (recommended first step)\nreskill publish --dry-run\n\n# Publish the skill\nreskill publish\n\n# Publish from a specific directory\nreskill publish ./path/to/skill\n\n# Skip confirmation\nreskill publish -y\n```\n\nThe skill directory must contain a valid `SKILL.md`. A `skill.json` with `name`, `version`, and `description` is also required for publishing.\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### First-Time Project Setup\n\n```bash\n# 1. Initialize the project\nreskill init -y\n\n# 2. Install skills your project needs\nreskill install github:user/skill1@v1.0.0 github:user/skill2@latest -y\n\n# 3. Verify installation\nreskill list\n\n# 4. Commit skills.json and skills.lock to version control\n# (These files ensure team members get the same skill versions)\n```\n\n### Team Collaboration\n\nWhen a teammate clones the project, they run:\n\n```bash\n# Reinstall all skills from skills.json (like npm install)\nreskill install\n```\n\nThis reads `skills.json` + `skills.lock` and installs the exact same versions.\n\n### Checking and Updating Skills\n\n```bash\n# Check which skills have newer versions\nreskill outdated\n\n# Update all skills\nreskill update\n\n# Update a specific skill\nreskill update skill-name\n```\n\n### Global vs Project-Level Installation\n\n| Scope   | Flag | Directory               | Use Case                                   |\n| ------- | ---- | ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| Project | -    | `.skills/` (in project) | Team-shared skills, committed to git       |\n| Global  | `-g` | `~/.agents/skills/`     | Personal skills, available in all projects |\n\n```bash\n# Project-level (default)\nreskill install github:user/skill\n\n# Global (personal, all projects)\nreskill install github:user/skill -g\n\n# Personal project-level (not saved to skills.json)\nreskill install github:user/skill --no-save\n```\n\n### Diagnosing Issues\n\n```bash\n# Run environment diagnostics\nreskill doctor\n\n# JSON output for programmatic use\nreskill doctor --json\n```\n\nThe `doctor` command checks: reskill version, Node.js version, Git availability, cache directory, `skills.json` validity, `skills.lock` sync, installed skills integrity, and network connectivity.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Error Message                        | Cause                                 | Solution                                                 |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `skills.json not found`              | Project not initialized               | Run `reskill init`                                       |\n| `Unknown scope @xyz`                 | No registry configured for this scope | Check `registries` in `skills.json` or use full Git URL  |\n| `Skill not found`                    | Skill name doesn''t exist in registry  | Verify skill name; check `reskill find <query>`          |\n| `Version not found`                  | Requested version doesn''t exist       | Run `reskill info <skill>` to see available versions     |\n| `Permission denied`                  | Auth issue when publishing            | Run `reskill login`; check token scope                   |\n| `Token is invalid or expired`        | Stale authentication                  | Re-authenticate with `reskill login --token <new-token>` |\n| `Network error`                      | Cannot reach Git host or registry     | Check network; run `reskill doctor` for diagnostics      |\n| `Conflict: directory already exists` | Skill already installed               | Use `--force` to reinstall                               |\n\n### Private Repositories\n\nreskill uses your existing git credentials (SSH keys or credential helper). For CI/CD environments:\n\n```bash\n# GitLab CI\ngit config --global url.\"https://gitlab-ci-token:${CI_JOB_TOKEN}@gitlab.company.com/\".insteadOf \"https://gitlab.company.com/\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:51.322Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agent Developers needing seamless skill management with declarative configuration and flexible versioning.","zh":"适合需要无缝技能管理、声明性配置和灵活版本控制的 AI Agent 开发人员。","ja":"宣言的構成と柔軟なバージョニングでスキル管理を無縫に行えるAIエージェント開発者に適しています。","ko":"선언적 구성 및 유연한 버전 관리로 무결점으로 스킬 관리를 수행할 수 있는 AI 에이전트 개발자에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de Agentes de IA que necesitan una gestión de habilidades sin problemas con configuración declarativa y versionado flexible.","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs d''Agents IA ayant besoin d''une gestion de compétences transparente avec une configuration déclarative et un versionnage flexible.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Agent-Entwickler, die eine reibungslose Fähigkeitsverwaltung mit deklarativem Konfiguration und flexibler Versionierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de Agentes de IA que precisam de gerenciamento de habilidades sem interrupções com configuração declarativa e versionamento flexível.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разработчиков агентов ИИ, которым требуется бесшовное управление навыками с декларативной конфигурацией и гибкой версионностью.","ar":"مثالي للمطورين وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مهارات بدون انقطاع مع تكوين اعلاني وتحكم إصدار مرن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage skills across projects and teams using Git-based package management, declarative configuration with skills.json and skills.lock, and flexible versioning, all while supporting multi-agent installations.","zh":"通过基于 Git 的包管理、使用 skills.json 和 skills.lock 的声明性配置以及灵活的版本控制，实现多个项目和团队之间的技能管理，同时支持多个代理的安装。","ja":"Gitベースのパッケージ管理、skills.jsonおよびskills.lockを使用した宣言的構成、柔軟なバージョニングをサポートし、複数のプロジェクトやチーム間でスキルを管理できるようにし、複数のエージェントのインストールもサポートします。","ko":"Git 기반 패키지 관리, skills.json 및 skills.lock를 사용한 선언적 구성, 유연한 버전 관리를 지원하여 여러 프로젝트 및 팀 간에 스킬을 관리할 수 있으며, 여러 에이전트의 설치도 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar habilidades en varios proyectos y equipos utilizando una gestión de paquetes basada en Git, configuración declarativa con skills.json y skills.lock, y versionado flexible, todo mientras admite instalaciones de multiagentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les compétences à travers plusieurs projets et équipes en utilisant une gestion de paquet basée sur Git, une configuration déclarative avec skills.json et skills.lock, et un versionnage flexible, le tout en supportant les installations multi-agents.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Fähigkeiten über mehrere Projekte und Teams hinweg zu verwalten, indem sie Git-basiertes Paketmanagement, deklarative Konfiguration mit skills.json und skills.lock sowie flexibles Versionieren verwenden, und unterstützt dabei Multi-Agent-Installationen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerenciar habilidades em vários projetos e equipes usando gerenciamento de pacotes baseado em Git, configuração declarativa com skills.json e skills.lock e versionamento flexível, tudo isso enquanto suporta instalações multiagentes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять навыками в различных проектах и командах, используя управление пакетами на основе Git, декларативную конфигурацию с skills.json и skills.lock и гибкую версионность, все это при поддержке многократных установок.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إدارة المهارات عبر المشاريع والفرق باستخدام إدارة حزم قائم على Git وتكوين اعلاني مع skills.json وskills.lock وتحكم إصدار مرن، كل ذلك مع دعم تثبيتات متعددة الوكلاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Installing skills across multiple projects","Managing skill versions for consistent performance","Sharing skills between teams and agents"],"zh":["跨多个项目安装技能","管理技能版本以实现一致的性能","在团队和代理之间共享技能"],"ja":["複数のプロジェクトにわたるスキルのインストール","一貫したパフォーマンスを実現するためのスキルバージョンの管理","チームやエージェント間でのスキルの共有"],"ko":["여러 프로젝트에 스킬을 설치하는 것","일관된 성능을 위해 스킬 버전을 관리하는 것","팀 및 에이전트 간에 스킬을 공유하는 것"],"es":["Instalación de habilidades en varios proyectos","Gestión de versiones de habilidades para un rendimiento coherente","Compartir habilidades entre equipos y agentes"],"fr":["Installation de compétences sur plusieurs projets","Gestion de versions de compétences pour des performances cohérentes","Partage de compétences entre équipes et agents"],"de":["Installation von Fähigkeiten über mehrere Projekte hinweg","Verwaltung von Fähigkeitsversionen für ein konsistentes Leistungsvermögen","Teilen von Fähigkeiten zwischen Teams und Agenten"],"pt":["Instalar habilidades em vários projetos","Gerenciar versões de habilidades para desempenho consistente","Compartilhar habilidades entre equipes e agentes"],"ru":["Установка навыков в нескольких проектах","Управление версиями навыков для последовательной производительности","Обмен навыками между командами и агентами"],"ar":["تثبيت المهارات عبر المشاريع المتعددة","إدارة إصدارات المهارات من أجل أداء متسق","مشاركة المهارات بين الفرق والوكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js >= 18.0.0","Global installation required for direct CLI usage"],"zh":["需要 Node.js >= 18.0.0","需要全局安装以直接使用 CLI"],"ja":["Node.js >= 18.0.0 が必要","直接の CLI 使用のためにグローバルインストールが必要"],"ko":["Node.js >= 18.0.0 필요","직접 CLI 사용을 위해 전역 설치가 필요"],"es":["Requiere Node.js >= 18.0.0","Se requiere instalación global para el uso directo de CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite Node.js >= 18.0.0","L''installation globale est requise pour l''utilisation directe de la CLI"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js >= 18.0.0","Eine globale Installation ist erforderlich für die direkte Verwendung von CLI"],"pt":["Requer Node.js >= 18.0.0","Instalação global necessária para uso direto do CLI"],"ru":["Требует Node.js >= 18.0.0","Требуется глобальная установка для прямого использования CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب Node.js >= 18.0.0","تثبيت عالمي مطلوب لاستخدام CLI مباشر"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f3e4ef76960bdf5e5d458ab836f161c571a5905f6fc119b755209687a2a76c1f","qualityScore":65}');
