nario 1]\n- [Specific scenario 2]\n- [Keyword trigger mentioned by user]\n\nDO NOT use when:\n-","body":"# Skill Name\n\n> **Philosophy**: Default to natural language. Use scripts ONLY for deterministic operations, complex I/O, or external API integration.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n[Concise example showing the most common use case - assume Claude is smart]\n\n**Example**:\n```bash\n# Process document\npython3 scripts/process.py input.pdf --output result.txt\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- [Specific scenario 1]\n- [Specific scenario 2]\n- [Keyword trigger mentioned by user]\n\nDO NOT use when:\n- [Alternative approach is better]\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: [Name]\n\n**Use when**: [Specific trigger or scenario]\n\n**Steps**:\n1. [Natural language instruction - be specific]\n2. [Conditional logic: If X, then Y; else Z]\n3. [Verification step]\n\n**Example**:\n```markdown\n1. Check if document exists: `ls docs/*.pdf`\n2. If PDF found: Extract text using `scripts/extract.py`\n3. If no PDF: Search for DOCX alternatives\n4. Validate output has non-zero size\n```\n\n**Common Issues**:\n- **Problem**: [What goes wrong]\n- **Solution**: [How to fix it]\n\n---\n\n### Workflow 2: [Name]\n\n[Follow same pattern as Workflow 1]\n\n---\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\nFor detailed information, see:\n- [Topic A Details](reference/topic-a.md) - When working with X\n- [Topic B Details](reference/topic-b.md) - For advanced Y usage\n- [API Reference](reference/api.md) - All available functions\n\n> **Note**: Claude loads these files ONLY when needed (progressive disclosure).\n\n---\n\n## Scripts (ONLY when justified)\n\n### script-name.py\n\n**Why this script is needed**: [ONE of these justifications]:\n- ✅ Deterministic validation (e.g., schema validation, syntax checking)\n- ✅ External API integration (e.g., GitHub API, third-party service)\n- ✅ Complex I/O operation (e.g., scanning thousands of files, binary parsing)\n- ✅ Safety-critical operation (e.g., git worktree, database migrations)\n- ❌ **NOT for**: Pattern matching, text analysis, conditional logic (Claude is better)\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\npython3 scripts/script-name.py --arg value\n```\n\n**Arguments**:\n- `--arg`: Description\n\n**Output**:\n```\nExpected output format\n```\n\n**Error Handling**:\nScript handles these errors explicitly (doesn''t punt to Claude):\n- Missing input file → Creates default\n- Permission denied → Uses alternative path\n- Network timeout → Retries with backoff\n\n---\n\n### validation-script.sh\n\n**Why needed**: [Justification - e.g., \"Bash validation faster than Python for simple checks\"]\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\n./scripts/validation-script.sh file.txt\n```\n\n**Returns**:\n- Exit code 0: Valid\n- Exit code 1: Invalid (with error message)\n\n---\n\n## Testing\n\n### Run Tests\n\n```bash\n# Unit tests\npytest tests/unit/ -v\n\n# Integration tests\npytest tests/integration/ -v\n\n# Specific test\npytest tests/test_specific.py::test_function -v\n```\n\n### Test Coverage\n\nCurrent coverage: XX%\n\n```bash\npytest --cov=scripts --cov-report=html\nopen htmlcov/index.html\n```\n\n---\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: [Common Use Case]\n\n**Scenario**: [Describe the situation]\n\n**Input**:\n```\n[What user provides]\n```\n\n**Process**:\n```markdown\n1. Claude reads input\n2. Validates format\n3. Calls script if needed: `python3 scripts/process.py`\n4. Formats output\n```\n\n**Output**:\n```\n[What user gets]\n```\n\n---\n\n### Example 2: [Edge Case]\n\n[Same structure as Example 1]\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\n### With Other Skills\n\nThis skill integrates with:\n- **skill-a**: Use after this skill for [purpose]\n- **skill-b**: Call this skill if [condition]\n\n### With Agents\n\nAgents that use this skill:\n- **agent-x** (Phase Y): Uses for [specific task]\n- **agent-z** (Phase W): Calls during [workflow step]\n\n---\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Required | Default | Description |\n|----------|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `VAR_NAME` | No | `default` | What this controls |\n\n### Settings File\n\nCreate `~/.config/skill-name/settings.yml`:\n\n```yaml\noption1: value1\noption2: value2\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n**Issue**: Script fails with \"Module not found\"\n\n**Solution**:\n```bash\npip install required-package\n```\n\n---\n\n**Issue**: Permission denied\n\n**Solution**:\n```bash\nchmod +x scripts/*.sh\nchmod +x scripts/*.py\n```\n\n---\n\n**Issue**: Output is empty\n\n**Solution**:\nCheck input file format. Expected: [format description]\n\n---\n\n## Development\n\n### Adding New Features\n\n1. Create feature branch\n2. Add tests FIRST (TDD)\n3. Implement in natural language if possible\n4. Add script ONLY if justified\n5. Update SKILL.md\n6. Run tests: `pytest -v`\n\n### Code Style\n\n- **Natural language**: Clear, concise, assume Claude is smart\n- **Python**: PEP 8, type hints, docstrings\n- **Bash**: ShellCheck compliant\n\n---\n\n## Changelog\n\n### v1.0.0 (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- Initial release\n- Core workflows implemented\n- [Feature X] added\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [External Documentation](https://example.com)\n- [Related Pattern](../../corpus/nodes/patterns/PATTERN-*.yml)\n- [ADR](../../corpus/nodes/decisions/ADR-*.yml)\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n❌ **DON''T**:\n- Create scripts for pattern matching (Claude is better)\n- Write Python for simple Bash operations\n- Add dependencies without justification\n- Create \"utils\" or \"helpers\" (be specific)\n\n✅ **DO**:\n- Default to natural language instructions\n- Use progressive disclosure for > 500 lines\n- Document why each script is needed\n- Test with Claude before assuming script is needed\n\n---\n\n**Skill maintained by**: [Team/Person]\n**Last updated**: YYYY-MM-DD\n**Questions**: Contact [channel/person]\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:05.117Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated software development lifecycle coordination.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化软件开发生命周期协调的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが自動化されたソフトウェア開発ライフサイクル調整を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 소프트웨어 개발 라이프사이클 조정을 필요로 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan coordinación automatizada del ciclo de vida del desarrollo de software.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une coordination automatique du cycle de vie du développement logiciel.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine automatisierte Koordination des Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklus benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de coordenação de ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software automatizado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированная координация жизненного цикла разработки программного обеспечения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق دورة حياة تطوير البرمجيات الآلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline development processes and improve efficiency using natural language and scripted deterministic operations, ideal for complex I/O and external API integration with tools like Python.","zh":"赋予代理流线开发流程和提高效率的能力，使用自然语言和脚本确定性操作，非常适合复杂的I/O和外部API集成，例如使用Python。","ja":"エージェントに開発プロセスを最適化し、効率を向上させる能力を与えます。自然言語とスクリプトによる決定論的操作を使用し、Pythonなどの外部APIとの統合に最適です。","ko":"에이전트에게 개발 프로세스를 최적화하고 효율성을 향상시키는 능력을 부여합니다. 자연어와 스크립트적 결정론적 연산을 사용하며, Python과 같은 외부 API와의 통합에 적합합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar los procesos de desarrollo y mejorar la eficiencia utilizando lenguaje natural y operaciones deterministas con script, ideales para I/O complejos y la integración de API externas con herramientas como Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser les processus de développement et d''améliorer l''efficacité en utilisant le langage naturel et les opérations déterministes avec script, idéales pour les I/O complexes et l''intégration d''API externes avec des outils comme Python.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Entwicklungsprozesse zu optimieren und die Effizienz durch die Verwendung von natürlicher Sprache und skriptbasierter deterministischer Operationen zu verbessern, ideal für komplexe I/O und die externe API-Integration mit Tools wie Python.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar os processos de desenvolvimento e melhorar a eficiência usando linguagem natural e operações determinísticas scriptadas, ideal para I/O complexo e integração de API externa com ferramentas como Python.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать процессы разработки и повысить эффективность с помощью естественного языка и скриптовых детерминированных операций, идеально подходит для сложного ввода/вывода и интеграции с внешними API с помощью инструментов như Python.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين عمليات التطوير وتحسين الكفاءة باستخدام اللغة الطبيعية والعمليات التحديدية المبرمجة، مثالية للعمليات الإدخال/الإخراج المعقدة وتكامل API الخارجي مع أدوات مثل Python."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating document processing","Streamlining software development lifecycles","Improving development efficiency"],"zh":["自动化文档处理","流线软件开发生命周期","提高开发效率"],"ja":["ドキュメント処理の自動化","ソフトウェア開発ライフサイクルの最適化","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["문서 처리 자동화","소프트웨어 개발 라이프사이클 최적화","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Automatización del procesamiento de documentos","Optimización de los ciclos de vida del desarrollo de software","Mejora de la eficiencia del desarrollo"],"fr":["Automatisation du traitement de documents","Optimisation des cycles de vie du développement logiciel","Amélioration de l''efficacité du développement"],"de":["Automatisierung der Dokumentenverarbeitung","Optimierung der Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklen","Verbesserung der Entwicklungseffizienz"],"pt":["Automatizar o processamento de documentos","Otimizar os ciclos de vida de desenvolvimento de software","Melhorar a eficiência do desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизация обработки документов","Оптимизация жизненных циклов разработки программного обеспечения","Повышение эффективности разработки"],"ar":["أتمتة معالجة المستندات","تحسين دورة حياة تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين كفاءة التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.x","Limited to deterministic operations and external API integration"],"zh":["需要Python 3.x","仅限确定性操作和外部API集成"],"ja":["Python 3.xが必要","決定論的操作と外部API統合のみ"],"ko":["Python 3.x 필요","결정론적 연산 및 외부 API 統合에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere Python 3.x","Limitado a operaciones deterministas y integración de API externas"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.x","Limité aux opérations déterministes et à l''intégration d''API externes"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.x","Begrenzt auf deterministische Operationen und externe API-Integration"],"pt":["Requer Python 3.x","Limitado a operações determinísticas e integração de API externa"],"ru":["Требуется Python 3.x","Ограничен детерминированными операциями и интеграцией с внешними API"],"ar":["يتطلب Python 3.x","محدود بالعمليات التحديدية وتكامل API الخارجي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"88afaf50005db576d7ae7e7c0b0e8f172fbc29da144f969bf5d4725b908160d9","qualityScore":65}');
